<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Biblica® Open New Luo Translation 2020</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samuel Mokwongo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samuel Mokwongo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Nywol mar Samuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1"/>Ne nitie ngʼat moro mane odak Ramathaim Zuf e piny gode mag Efraim. Ngʼatno ne nyinge Elkana wuod Jeroham ma wuod Elihu wuod Tohu, wuod Zuf ma ja-Efraim. <verse eid="1SA 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2"/>Ne en gi mon ariyo ma moro ne nyinge Hana to machielo nyinge Penina. Penina ne nigi nyithindo to Hana ne ongego.<verse eid="1SA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3"/>Higa ka higa ngʼatni ne wuok e dalane kodhi lemo kendo timo misango ne Jehova Nyasaye Maratego e Shilo, kuma Hofni gi Finehas, yawuot Eli ariyo, ne jodolo mag Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4"/>Kane odiechiengʼ ochopo ma Elkana chiwoe misango, ne omiyo Penina gi yawuote kod nyige lemo mar ringʼo. <verse eid="1SA 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5"/>Hana to nomiyo nyadiriyo nikech nohere, kendo Jehova Nyasaye noloro iye mane ok onyal nywol. <verse eid="1SA 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6"/>Kendo nikech Jehova Nyasaye noloro iye mane ok onyal nywol, nyieke ne osiko mana kajare mondo owangʼ iye. <verse eid="1SA 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7"/>Ajarano ne dhi nyime higa ka higa, to moloyo, e kinde ka kinde mane Hana dhi e od Jehova Nyasaye. E kindego nyieke ne osiko kawangʼo iye gi wechego manyaka oywagi ma ok onyal kata chiemo. <verse eid="1SA 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8"/>Elkana jaode ne jawachone niya, “Hana, angʼo momiyo iywak? Angʼo momoni chiemo? Angʼo momiyo chunyi osin? Donge onego aloni yawuowi apar?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9"/>Chiengʼ moro kane gisetieko chiemo kod metho kane gin Shilo, Hana nochungʼ malo. Sano noyudo ka Eli ma jadolo obet e kom but dhood hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10"/>Nikech Hana ne nigi chuny malit noywak ahinya kolamo Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11"/>Kendo nokwongʼore kowacho niya, “Yaye Jehova Nyasaye Maratego ka inine masich jatichni kendo ipara ma wiyi ok owil gi jatichni ma imiye wuowi, eka anachiwe ne Jehova Nyasaye e ndalo duto mar ngimane, kendo wembe ok nolielgo wiye.”<verse eid="1SA 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12"/>Kaka nomedo lamo Jehova Nyasaye, Eli ne ngʼiye ka nono dhoge. <verse eid="1SA 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13"/>Hana to ne lemo gie chunye to dhoge to ne diemore adiema to dwonde to ok winji. Eli noparo ni omer <verse eid="1SA 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14"/>mi nowachone niya, “Nyaka karangʼo mibiro siko kimer?” We metho.<verse eid="1SA 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15"/>Hana ne odwoke niya, Ok kamano ruodha. An mana dhako man-gi lit ahinya. Ok asebedo kamadho kongʼo kata gik mamero ji, to achiwo chunya ne Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16"/>Kik ikaw jatichni ka dhako ma timbege mono. Asebedo kalamo ka nikech chandruok gi kuyona.<verse eid="1SA 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17"/>Eli nodwoke kawachone niya, “Dhi gi kwe, mad Nyasach Israel miyi gima isebedo kikwaye.”<verse eid="1SA 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18"/>Hana nowacho niya, “Mad jatichni yud ngʼwono e wangʼi.” Eka nodhi e yore owuon mochamo gimoro, kendo wangʼe ne koro onge kuyo.<verse eid="1SA 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19"/>Kinyne gokinyi negichungʼ mine gilemo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye eka negidok dalagi Rama. Elkana nobedo e achiel gi chiege ma Hana eka Jehova Nyasaye nopare. <verse eid="1SA 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20"/>E kindeno Hana nomako ich monywolo wuode. Nochake ni Samuel kowacho niya, “Nikech ne akwaye Jehova Nyasaye.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hana osingo ni Nyasaye Samuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21"/>Kane Elkana gi jaode jodhi timo misango mar higa ka higa ne Jehova Nyasaye kendo chopo singruokne, <verse eid="1SA 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22"/>Hana ne ok odhi. Ne owacho ne chwore niya, “Ka nyathi ma wuowi oseweyo dhoth to abiro tere e nyim Jehova Nyasaye kendo obiro dak kuno nyaka chiengʼ.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23"/>Elkana chwore ne owachone niya, “Tim kaka ineno ni berni. Rit nyaka nyathi we dhoth kendo mad Jehova Nyasaye kende ema chop wachne.” Omiyo dhakoni nobet dala kodhodho wuode nyaka noweyo dhodhe.<verse eid="1SA 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24"/>Bangʼ kane nyathi oseweyo dhoth nokawo wuowi modhi kode kata obedo ni pod otin kamano, nodhi gi nyarwath ma hike adek gi mogo madirom depe ariyo gi divai lita piero ariyo gariyo, eka nokele e od Jehova Nyasaye man Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25"/>Kane giseyangʼo rwath ne gitero wuowino ir Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26"/>Eka nowachone niya, “Yaye ruodha, akwongʼora e nyimi ni an e dhako mane ochungʼ buti cha kalamo Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27"/>Ne alamo kakwayo nyathini kendo Jehova Nyasaye osedwoka kendo omiya gima ne akwaye. <verse eid="1SA 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28"/>Omiyo sani achiwe ne Jehova Nyasaye. Kuom ngimane duto asechiwe ne Jehova Nyasaye.” Kendo Eli nopako Jehova Nyasaye kanyo.<verse eid="1SA 1:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Lamo mar Hana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1"/>Eka Hana nolemo kawacho niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">“Chunya oil gi Jehova Nyasaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">Jehova Nyasaye osetingʼa malo ma tekona onenore.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Gi dhoga asungora ne wasika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">nikech amor gi warruokni.<verse eid="1SA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2"/>“Onge ngʼama ler ka Jehova Nyasaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">kendo onge moro makmana in;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">onge Lwanda machal gi Nyasachwa.<verse eid="1SA 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3"/>“Weuru siko ka uwuoyo gi sunga ahinya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">kata weyo dhogi wuoyo gi ngʼayi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">nikech Jehova Nyasaye en Nyasaye mongʼeyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">nimar en ema onono timbe.<verse eid="1SA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4"/>“Atunge mag jolweny osetur,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">to jogo mayom yom osemi teko.<verse eid="1SA 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5"/>Jogo mane nigo koro tiyo mondo oyud chiemo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">to jogo mane denyo koro kegi orumo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Mano mane migumba osenywolo nyithindo abiriyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">to mano mane nigi yawuowi to koro odongʼ nono.<verse eid="1SA 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6"/>“Jehova Nyasaye ema kelo tho, kendo chiwo ngima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">en ema onego kendo ochiero.<verse eid="1SA 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7"/>Jehova Nyasaye ema kelo dhier gi mwandu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">josunga odwoko piny, to joma muol otingʼo malo.<verse eid="1SA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8"/>Otingʼo jachan malo kogolo e buru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">kendo otingʼo ngʼama odhier malo kogolo e ipidh yugi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">omiyo gibedo kaachiel gi yawuot ruodhi bende</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">omiyo gibedoe kombe moyiedhi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:8"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">“Nimar mise mag piny gin mag Jehova Nyasaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">kanyo ema oserenjoe piny ngima.<verse eid="1SA 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9"/>Obiro chiko tiende joge maler</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">to joricho to nolal ei mudho.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">“Ngʼato ok lochi mana nikech teko;<verse eid="1SA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10"/>joma piem gi Jehova Nyasaye ibiro tur matindo tindo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Obiro mornegi gie polo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">kendo Jehova Nyasaye biro ngʼado bura ne tunge piny.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:10"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">“Obiro miyo ruodhe teko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">kendo obiro miyo teko mar ngʼate mowir onenre.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11"/>Eka Elkana nodok dalane Rama to wuowino noweyo katiyo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye e bwo Eli jadolo.<verse eid="1SA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yawuot Eli macheje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12"/>Yawuot Eli ne timbegi mono kendo ne ok gidew Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13"/>Koro ma e tim mane jodolo timo ne ji kane ngʼato angʼata ne chiwo misango, kendo kane pod ringʼo chiek, to jatij jadolo ne biroga gi uma mabor man-gi leke adek e lwete. <verse eid="1SA 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14"/>Nolutoga umano e sufuria, kata aguch ringʼo gi agulni mamoko mag tedo kendo jadolo ne kawo ringʼo moro amora ma uma ochwoyo. Mano e kaka negitimo ni jo-Israel duto mane biro Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15"/>To kata ka boche ne pok owangʼ, jatich jadolo ne biroga ma wach ne ngʼama chiwo misango niya, “Mi jadolo ringʼo moko mondo obul nikech ok obi yie kawo ringʼo mosetedi kuomi makmana manumu.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16"/>To ka ngʼatno nowachone niya, “We mondo boche okuong owangʼ mondi eka ikaw gimoro amora midwaro,” to jatijno nedwoko niya, “Ngangʼ miyago sani; ka ok imiyago, to abiro kawe githuon.”<verse eid="1SA 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17"/>Richo mag yawuowigi ne lich ahinya e nyim Jehova Nyasaye nikech ne gichayo gima ochiw ne Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="1SA 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18"/>Samuel to ne tiyo, e nyim Jehova Nyasaye ka en wuowi matin korwako law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod. <verse eid="1SA 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19"/>Higa ka higa min ne twangʼone law matin kendo terone e kinde mane ojadhi gi chwore ka gidhi timo misango mar higa ka higa. <verse eid="1SA 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20"/>Eli negwedho Elkana gi chiege kowacho niya, “Mad Jehova Nyasaye miyi nyithindo gi dhakoni mondo ochul kar mane olamo kokwayo kendo omiyo Jehova Nyasaye.” Bangʼe negidok dalagi. <verse eid="1SA 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21"/>To Jehova Nyasaye ne mor gi Hana; kendo nomako ich monywolo yawuowi adek gi nyiri ariyo. To Samuel nodongo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="1SA 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22"/>Koro Eli mane oseti ahinya; nowinjo timbe duto mane yawuote timo ne jo-Israel kaka negiterore gi mon mane tiyo e dhoranga Hemb Romo. <verse eid="1SA 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23"/>Nowachonegi niya, “Angʼo momiyo utimo timbegi? Awinjo kuom ji duto timbeu marichogi. <verse eid="1SA 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24"/>Ooyo yawuota; ok en huma maber ma awinjo kalandore e kind oganda Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25"/>Ka ngʼato okethone ngʼat machielo to Nyasaye nyalo thegogi; to ka koro ngʼato oketho ne Jehova Nyasaye, en ngʼa mabiro kwayone?” Kata kamano yawuotego ne ok owinjo siem wuon-gi nikech Jehova Nyasaye ne osechano mondo oneg-gi.<verse eid="1SA 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26"/>To wuowi Samuel nomedo dongo; kendo Jehova Nyasaye kod ji ne mor kode.<verse eid="1SA 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wach mokor makwedo od Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27"/>Ngʼat Nyasaye moro nobiro ir Eli mowachone niya, “Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho, ‘Donge ne afwenyora ratiro ni od wuonu kane pod gin Misri e bwo loch Farao? <verse eid="1SA 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28"/>Nayiero wuonu e kind dhout Israel mondo obed jadolona mondo oidh malo e kendona mar misango, mondo owangʼ ubani, kendo orwak law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod e nyima. Ne achako amiyo od wuonu misengini duto ma jo-Israel wangʼo gi mach. <verse eid="1SA 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29"/>Angʼo momiyo ichayo misangona kod chiwo ma asechiwoni kar dakna? Angʼo momiyo imiyo yawuoti duongʼ moloya ka uchiemo kendo ubedo machwe un uwegi kendo ka uyiero kuonde mabeyoe moloyo kuom chiwo ka chiwo ma joga Israel chiwo?’ <verse eid="1SA 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30"/>“Kuom mano Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach jo-Israel wacho ni, ‘Ne asingora ni odi kod od wuonu nobed jotichna nyaka chiengʼ.’ To koro Jehova Nyasaye wacho ni, ‘Ma ok anatim! Joma miya duongʼ ema abiro miyo duongʼ, to joma ochaya ok nobed gimoro. <verse eid="1SA 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31"/>Ndalo biro ma anatiekie tekoni kod teko mar od wuonu, mi ok noyudi ngʼato angʼata moti e dhoodu. <verse eid="1SA 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32"/>Kendo inibed gi chandruok e kar dakna kata obedo ni jo-Israel none ber to ei anywolani to onge ngʼat manodag amingʼa mabed moti. <verse eid="1SA 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33"/>Ngʼato ka ngʼato kuomu ma ok agolo e tich mar kendona mar misango anawe mondo omi wengeu opongʼ gi pi wangʼ kendo mondo omi chunyu lit, to ogandani duto to notho kapod gin jomatindo.<verse eid="1SA 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34"/>“ ‘To gima timore ne yawuoti ariyo ma gin Hofni gi Finehas nobedni ranyisi kendo gibiro tho odiechiengʼ achiel. <verse eid="1SA 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35"/>To abiro chungo Jadolona awuon ma en ngʼat ma ja-adiera, manotim gik moko duto man e chunya kod pacha. Abiro guro ode matek, kendo obiro tiyo ndalo duto e nyim ngʼata ma awiro. <verse eid="1SA 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36"/>To jogo mane dongʼ e dhoodi nobi ire kakulore e nyime mondo omi fedha gi kuon kendo nokwaye niya, “Yie imiya tich dolo moro mondo ayud kaka dayud chiemo machamo.” ’ ”<verse eid="1SA 2:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Jehova Nyasaye oluongo Samuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1"/>Wuowino miluongo ni Samuel ne tiyo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye e bwo Eli. E kindeno wach Jehova Nyasaye ne nok kendo ne onge fweny mangʼeny.<verse eid="1SA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2"/>Eli makoro wengene ne osechako imore kendo ne ok onyal neno maber, noyudo nindo e kare mapile. <verse eid="1SA 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3"/>To taya mar Nyasaye ne pok otho, Samuel bende ne nindo ei hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye, kama Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye ne nitie. <verse eid="1SA 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4"/>Eka Jehova Nyasaye noluongo Samuel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:4">Samuel nodwoko niya, “Era ee.” <verse eid="1SA 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5"/>Eka noringo odhi ir Eli mowacho niya, “Era ee; nikech ne iluonga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">To Eli nowachone niya, “Ne ok aluongi dog inindi.” Omiyo nodok monindo.<verse eid="1SA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6"/>Kendo Jehova Nyasaye nochako oluongo niya, “Samuel!” Eka Samuel nochungʼ modhi ir Eli mowachone niya, “Era ee, nikech ne iluonga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Eli nowachone niya, “Wuoda, an ne ok aluongi dog inindi.”<verse eid="1SA 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7"/>E kindeno Samuel ne pod ok ongʼeyo Jehova Nyasaye nikech wach Jehova Nyasaye ne pok ofwenyorene.<verse eid="1SA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8"/>Jehova Nyasaye ne ochako oluongo Samuel mar adek kendo Samuel noa malo modhi ir Eli mowachone niya, “Era ee nikech iluonga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Eka Eli nofwenyo ni kara Jehova Nyasaye ema, luongo wuowino. <verse eid="1SA 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9"/>Omiyo Eli nowacho ni Samuel niya, “Dhiyo inindi, to ka oluongi to iwach ni, ‘Wuo Jehova Nyasaye, nikech jatichni winjo.’ ” Samuel ne odok monindo kare.<verse eid="1SA 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10"/>Jehova Nyasaye nobiro mochungʼ kanyo moluongo kaka nosebedo kotimo, “Samuel! Samuel!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Samuel nowachone niya, “Wuo nikech jatichni winjo.”<verse eid="1SA 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11"/>Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Samuel niya, “Ne adhi timo gimoro e Israel mabiro miyo ji duto mowinjo itgi nosakni. <verse eid="1SA 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12"/>E kindeno abiro chopo weche mane awacho kuom Eli ka akwede kod mane awacho kuom ode aa chakruok nyaka giko. <verse eid="1SA 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13"/>Nimar ne anyise ni abiro ngʼado bura ne joode nyaka chiengʼ nikech richono mane ongʼeyo, yawuote ne timo timbe maricho, to ne ok okwerogi. <verse eid="1SA 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14"/>Emomiyo nasingora ne dhood Eli ni, ‘Richogi ok nyal pwodh gi misango kata chiwo.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15"/>Samuel nonindo nyaka okinyi eka noyawo dhoudi mag od Jehova Nyasaye. Noluor wacho ne Eli fweny, <verse eid="1SA 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16"/>to Eli noluonge mowachone niya, “Samuel wuoda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Samuel nodwoke niya, “Era ee.”<verse eid="1SA 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17"/>Eli nopenje niya, “En angʼo mane owachoni? Kik ipanda wach. Mad Nyasaye chwadi matek ka dipo ni ipandona gimoro amora ma onyisi.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18"/>Omiyo Samuel nonyise weche duto ma ok opandone gimoro. Eka Eli nowachone niya, “En e Jehova Nyasaye, we otim gima oneno ni longʼone.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19"/>Jehova Nyasaye ne ni kod Samuel kaka nomedo dongo kendo weche duto mane owacho onge mane kadho ma ok otimore kamano. <verse eid="1SA 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20"/>Jo-Israel duto koa Dan nyaka Bersheba, nofwenyo ni Samuel oseromo bedo janabi mar Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21"/>Jehova Nyasaye nomedo fwenyore e Shilo kendo kanyo ne ofwenyore owuon ne Samuel kuom wachne.<verse eid="1SA 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1"/>Kendo wach Samuel nochopo ne jo-Israel duto.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1SA 4:1">Jo-Filistia okawo Sandug Muma</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Noyudo jo-Israel odhi kedo gi jo-Filistia. Jo-Israel ne ogo kambi Ebeneza to jo-Filistia to nogo kambi Afek. <verse eid="1SA 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2"/>Jo-Filistia noyaro ne lweny mondo orom gi jo-Israel, kendo lweny nolandore. Jo-Israel ne olo gi jo-Filistia mine ginego ji madirom alufu angʼwen e paw lweny. <verse eid="1SA 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3"/>Kane jolweny odwogo e kambi, jodong Israel nopenjogi niya, “Angʼo momiyo Jehova Nyasaye oseweyo jo-Filistia oloyowa kawuononi? Waomuru Sandug Muma mar Singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye man Shilo, mondo odhi kodwa kendo oreswa e lwet wasikwa.”<verse eid="1SA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4"/>Eka oganda nooro jomoko mondo odhi Shilo kendo negidwogo gi Sandug Muma mar Singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye Maratego, mobedo e kind kerubi. Kendo yawuot Eli ariyo ma gin Hofni gi Finehas nobiro gi Sandug Muma mar Singruok mar Nyasaye.<verse eid="1SA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5"/>Kane Sandug Muma mar Singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye ochopo e kambi, jo-Israel duto nokok matek ma piny noyiengni. <verse eid="1SA 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6"/>Jo-Filistia kane owinjo koko negipenjo niya, “Mano to koko manade magore e kambi mar jo-Hibrania?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Kane gifwenyo ni Sandug Muma mar Singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye osekel e kambi, <verse eid="1SA 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7"/>jo-Filistia nobedo maluor kagiwacho niya, “Nyasaye osebiro e kambi. Wan gi chandruok! Gima kama pok otimore nyaka nene. <verse eid="1SA 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8"/>To mano kaka wan gi masira! En ngʼa mabiro resowa e lwet nyiseche maratekegi? Gin nyiseche mane ogoyo jo-Misri gi masiche mayoreyore e thim. <verse eid="1SA 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9"/>Beduru motegno un jo-Filistia! Beduru gi chir kaka chwo ka ok kamano to udhi bedo wasumb jo-Hibrania mana kaka gisebedonu. Omiyo beduru jochir kendo ukedi!”<verse eid="1SA 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10"/>Omiyo jo-Filistia nokedo kendo, jo-Israel nolo mi ngʼato ka ngʼato noringo kadhi e hembe. Noneg ji mathoth ahinya! Noneg jolweny mag jo-Israel alufu piero adek. <verse eid="1SA 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11"/>Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye ne okaw, yawuot Eli ariyo Hofni gi Finehas ne onegi.<verse eid="1SA 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tho mar Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12"/>Chiengʼ onogo ja-Benjamin moro noringo koa e lweny modhi Shilo, lepe ne oyiech kendo wiye notimo buru. <verse eid="1SA 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13"/>Kane ochopo, nonwangʼo Eli kobet e kome e dir yo, ka orito nimar luoro nomake nikech Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye. Kane ngʼatno odonjo e dala mowacho gima ne osetimore, ji duto mane ni ei dala nomuoch gi nduru.<verse eid="1SA 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14"/>Eli nowinjo nduru mopenjo niya, “Nduru magoreni nyiso angʼo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:14">Ngʼatno noreto piyo kodhi ir Eli ma hike <verse eid="1SA 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15"/>ne oseromo higni piero ochiko gaboro kendo wengene nosedinore makoro ok onen. <verse eid="1SA 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16"/>Nowachone Eli niya, “Aringo ka awuok kar lweny mana kawuononi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Eli nopenjo niya, “Angʼo motimore wuoda?”<verse eid="1SA 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17"/>Ngʼat mane okelo wach nodwoko niya, “Israel nolo gi jo-Filistia, kendo jolweny otho mangʼeny. Koda ka yawuoti ariyo, Hofni gi Finehas osetho, to Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye okaw modhi.”<verse eid="1SA 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18"/>Kane ohulo wach mar Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye, Eli nogore piny ataro koa e kom manobetie e bath rangach. Ngʼute ne otur mi notho, nikech ne oti kendo ne ochwe. Ne osetelo ne Israel kuom higni piero angʼwen.<verse eid="1SA 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19"/>Chi wuode, ma jaod Finehas, ne nigi ich mochiegni nywol. To kane owinjo wach ni Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye osekaw kendo ni kwar mare gi chwore osetho, muoch nochako kaye mi nonywol, kata kamano nywolne nobiro marach. <verse eid="1SA 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20"/>Kane odwa tho, mon mane chole nowachone niya, “Kik iluor nikech isenywolo wuowi.” To ne ok odwokogi kata dewogi.<verse eid="1SA 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21"/>Nochako nyathi ma wuowino ni Ikabod kowacho niya, “Duongʼ oseweyo Israel, nikech negikawo Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye kod tho mar kwar mare gi mar chwore.” <verse eid="1SA 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22"/>Nowacho niya, “Duongʼ oseweyo Israel, nimar Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye osekaw.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Sandug Muma ni Ashdod gi Ekron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1"/>Kane jo-Filistia osekawo Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye ne gigole Ebeneza mi gitere Ashdod. <verse eid="1SA 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2"/>Eka negitingʼo Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye mi gitero ei hekalu mar Dagon kendo negikete bath Dagon. <verse eid="1SA 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3"/>Kane jo-Ashdod ochiewo kinyne gokinyi mangʼich negiyudo ka Dagon, nogore piny auma e nyim Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye! Negichungo Dagon mi gidwoke kare. <verse eid="1SA 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4"/>To chiengʼ mar ariyo gokinyi kane gichiewo, negiyudo Dagon kanyo kosegore piny auma e nyim Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye. Wiye gi lwetene ne osetur kendo ne ni e ndiri, dende kende ema ne odongʼ. <verse eid="1SA 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5"/>Mano ema omiyo nyaka chil kawuono jodolo mag Dagon kata mana ngʼama donjo e hekalu mar Dagon e Ashdod ok nyon ndiri.<verse eid="1SA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6"/>Lwet Jehova Nyasaye nosando jo-Ashdod kod kuonde machiegni kodgi, noketo luoro kuomgi, bende nogoyogi gi tuo mar buche. <verse eid="1SA 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7"/>Kane jo-Ashdod oneno gima ne timore, negiwacho niya, “Sandug Muma mar Nyasach jo-Israel kik bed kodwa ka, nikech lwete osesandowa kaachiel gi Dagon ma nyasachwa.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8"/>Omiyo negiluongo ruodhi duto mag jo-Filistia ma gipenjogi niya, “Watim angʼo gi Sandug Muma mar Nyasach jo-Israel?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Mine gidwoko niya, “Kawuru Sandug Muma mar Nyasach jo-Israel uter Gath.” Kamano negigolo Sandug Muma mar Nyasach jo-Israel.<verse eid="1SA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9"/>Bangʼ kane gisegole, Jehova Nyasaye nokelo chandruok ne dala maduongʼno momiyo luoro malich omakogi. Ne ogoyo jomatindo gi jomadongo mar dala maduongʼno gi tuo buche. <verse eid="1SA 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10"/>Omiyo ne gitero Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye Ekron.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:10">Kane Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye nidonjogo Ekron, jo-Ekron noywak kawacho niya, “Gisekelo Sandug Muma mar Nyasach jo-Israel kuomwa mondo onegwa kaachiel gi jowa.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11"/>Omiyo negiluongo ruodhi duto mag jo-Filistia mi giwachonegi niya, “Goluru Sandug Muma mar Nyasach jo-Israel; dwokeuru kare owuon, ka ok kamano to obiro negowa kaachiel gi jowa.” Nikech tho nosepongʼo dala maduongʼ gi kihondko; lwet Nyasaye nosandogi ahinya. <verse eid="1SA 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12"/>Joma ne ok otho to tuo buche nomako kendo ywak mar dala maduongʼno nochopo nyaka e polo.<verse eid="1SA 5:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Sandug Muma odwok Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1"/>Kane Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye osebet e piny jo-Filistia kuom dweche abiriyo, <verse eid="1SA 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2"/>jo-Filistia noluongo jodolo gi ajuoke mi giwacho niya, “Wabiro timo angʼo gi Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye? Nyiswauru kaka onego wadwoke kare.”<verse eid="1SA 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3"/>Negidwoko niya, “Ka udwoko Sandug Muma mar Nyasach jo-Israel, to kik udwoke nono, nyaka une ni udwoke gi misango mar pwodhruok e ketho, eka nochangu, bende ubiro ngʼeyo gima omiyo lwete ok oseweyo sandou.”<verse eid="1SA 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4"/>Jo-Filistia nopenjo niya, “En misango machal nade mar pwodhruok e ketho monego wakowne?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Negidwoko niya, “Dhahabu abich molos machal gi buche gi dhahabu abich molos machal gi oyieyo ma kwan-gi rom gi ruodhi mag jo-Filistia, nikech masich tuo nomakou kaachiel gi ruodhiu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5"/>Losuru gik machal gi buche kod machal gi oyieyo maketho pinyu, kendo miuru Nyasach jo-Israel duongʼ. Dipo ka ongʼwononu moweyo sandou kaachiel gi nyisecheu gi pinyu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6"/>Angʼo momiyo chunyu pek kaka jo-Misri gi Farao notimo? Kane osandogi, donge negiweyo jo-Israel odhi kuma ne onego gidhiye?<verse eid="1SA 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7"/>“Omiyo sani ikuru gari manyien, gi dwesni ariyo ma osenywol to pok otwe e jok. Tweuru dwesnigi e gari, nyiroye to tweuru e loch. <verse eid="1SA 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8"/>Kawuru Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye mondo uket e gari, keturu Sanduku machielo bute mondo uketie gik molos gi dhahabu muterone kaka misango mipwodhruokgo e ketho, kendo uweye odhi, <verse eid="1SA 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9"/>to sikuru ka ungʼiye. Ka odhi mochomo thurgi nyaka, Beth Shemesh, to kara Jehova Nyasaye ema osekelo sand maduongʼni kuomwa. To ka ok otimore kamano to wabiro ngʼeyo ni lwete ok ema osesandowa to ni mani obironwa abira.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10"/>Omiyo negitimo kamano. Negikawo dwesni ariyo machal kamano mi gitweyo e gari kendo gitweyo nyiroye e loch. <verse eid="1SA 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11"/>Negiketo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye e gari bende negiketo Sanduku motingʼo dhahabu molos ka oyieyo gi dhahabu molos ka buche. <verse eid="1SA 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12"/>To dwesni nowuok kochiko Beth Shemesh tir, negiluwo yo ka gidhi to giywak, ne ok gibaro korachwich kata koracham. Ruodhi mag jo-Filistia ne luwogi nyaka negichopo e tongʼ man Beth Shemesh.<verse eid="1SA 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13"/>E kindeno jo-Beth Shemesh ne kayo ngano e holo, kane gitingʼo wangʼ-gi malo mi gineno Sandug Muma, negimor ka ginene. <verse eid="1SA 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14"/>Gari nobiro nyaka e puoth Joshua ma ja-Beth Shemesh, modhi mochungʼ but lwanda maduongʼ. Ji nobaro yiend gari mi gichiwo dwesnigo ka misango miwangʼo pep ne Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15"/>Jo-Lawi noloro Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye kaachiel gi Sanduku manotingʼo gik molos gi dhahabu, mine giketogi ewi lwanda maduongʼ. Odiechiengʼno jo-Beth Shemesh nochiwo misango miwangʼo pep gi misengini mamoko ni Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16"/>Ruodhi abich mag jo-Filistia noneno gik manotimore duto mine gidok odiechiengno nyaka Ekron.<verse eid="1SA 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17"/>Magi e dhahabu molos ka buche mane jo-Filistia oorone Jehova Nyasaye ka misango mipwodhruokgo e ketho ka moro ka moro ochungʼ kar Ashdod, Gaza, Ashkelon, Gath kod Ekron. <verse eid="1SA 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18"/>To kwan mar dhahabu molos ka oyieyo ne chal gi kwan dalane mag jo-Filistia mag Ruodhi abich, ne gin mier matindo mochiel motegno man-gi mieregi. Lwanda maduongʼ, mane giketoe Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye, pod ochungʼ kanyo ka ranyisi e puoth Joshua ja-Beth Shemesh nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="1SA 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19"/>To Nyasaye nogoyo jo-Beth Shemesh moko, monego ji piero abiriyo nikech negingʼiyo ii Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye. Ji noywak malit nikech sand mane Jehova Nyasaye osekelonegi, <verse eid="1SA 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20"/>kendo jo-Beth Shemesh nopenjo niya, “En ngʼa manyalo chungʼ e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, Nyasaye malerni? Ngʼatno ma Sandugni nodhine koa ka?”<verse eid="1SA 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21"/>Eka negioro joote ne jo-Kiriath Jearim, kagiwacho niya, “Jo-Filistia osedwogo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye. Biuru mondo ukawe udhi kode.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1"/>Jo-Kiriath Jearim nobiro mokawo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye. Ne gitere e od Abinadab mane ni e got, kendo negiwalo Eliazar ma wuode mondo orit Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="1SA 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samuel oloyo jo-Filistia Mizpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2"/>Sandug Muma nobudho Kiriath Jearim kuom higni piero ariyo, jo-Israel duto nokuyo mi odok ir Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3"/>Kendo Samuel nowachone jo-Israel duto niya, “Ka udwogo ir Jehova Nyasaye gi chunyu duto, to goluru nyiseche mag jopinje mamoko ma un-go kod mag Ashtoreth, to chiwreuru ni Jehova Nyasaye kendo en kende ema utine, mi noresu kogolou e lwet jo-Filistia.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4"/>Omiyo jo-Israel nogolo mowito nyisechegi mag Baal gi mag Ashtoreth; mine gitiyo ne Jehova Nyasaye kende.<verse eid="1SA 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5"/>Eka Samuel nowacho niya, “Chokuru jo-Israel duto Mizpa, anto abiro lemo ka akwayonu Jehova Nyasaye.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6"/>Kane gisechokore kanyakla Mizpa ne giumbo pi mi gipuko e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. Odiechiengno negitweyo chiemo ka gihulo richo kagiwacho niya, “Waseketho e nyim Jehova Nyasaye.” Kendo Samuel nobedo jatend Israel e piny Mizpa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7"/>Kane jo-Filistia owinjo ni jo-Israel nosechokore Mizpa, ruodhi mag jo-Filistia nobiro mondo omonjgi. To kane jo-Israel owinjo wachno, luoro nomakogi. <verse eid="1SA 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8"/>Negiwachone Samuel niya, “Kik iwe ma ok ikwayonwa Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa mondo omi oreswa e lwet jo-Filistia.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9"/>Eka Samuel nokawo nyarombo ma pod dhoth mi ochiwo ka misango miwangʼo pep ni Jehova Nyasaye. Noywak ni Jehova Nyasaye e lo jo-Israel, mi Jehova Nyasaye ne odwoke.<verse eid="1SA 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10"/>Kane Samuel pod chiwo misango miwangʼo pep, jo-Filistia noyworo machiegni mondo oked gi jo-Israel. To chiengʼno Jehova Nyasaye nomiyo polo omor matek kuom jo-Filistia manomiyogi luoro ma gikee ka gikia kuma gidhiye, kendo negiringo e nyim jo-Israel. <verse eid="1SA 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11"/>Jo-Israel nowuok Mizpa molawo jo-Filistia ma ginegogi e yo nyaka Beth-Kar.<verse eid="1SA 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12"/>Eka Samuel nokawo kidi mochungo e kind Mizpa gi Shen. Nochake ni Ebeneza kowacho niya, “Jehova Nyasaye osekonyowa nyaka ka.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13"/>Omiyo jo-Filistia nolo mine ok gichako gimonjo piny jo-Israel kendo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 7:13">E kinde duto mane Samuel pod ngima, lwet Jehova Nyasaye nosando jo-Filistia. <verse eid="1SA 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14"/>Mier mane jo-Filistia omayo jo-Israel kochakore Ekron nyaka Gath nodwoknegi, Israel noreso gwenge mane okiewo kode koa e loch jo-Filistia. Kendo kwe nobedo e kind Israel gi jo-Amor.<verse eid="1SA 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15"/>Samuel nobedo jangʼad bura e piny Israel e ndalo duto mag ngimane. <verse eid="1SA 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16"/>Higa ka higa nolworore koa Bethel nyaka Gilgal gi Mizpa kongʼado bura ne jo-Israel kuonde duto. <verse eid="1SA 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17"/>To kinde duto ne odokga Rama, kuma dalane ne nitie, kanyo bende ne ongʼadoe bura ne jo-Israel. Ne ogero kendo mar misango ne Jehova Nyasaye kanyo.<verse eid="1SA 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Jo-Israel okwayo mondo omigi Ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1"/>Kane Samuel oseti noketo yawuote mondo obed jongʼad bura e Israel. <verse eid="1SA 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2"/>Nying wuode makayo ne Joel to nying wuowi mar ariyo ne Abija, kendo negitiyo e Bersheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3"/>To yawuotego ne ok oluwo timbene. Ne gibaro kuom dwaro mwandu malangʼ kendo ka gikawo asoya bende ka gingʼado bura marach.<verse eid="1SA 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4"/>Omiyo jodong Israel noromo kamoro achiel mine gidhi ir Samuel Rama. <verse eid="1SA 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5"/>Negiwachone niya, “In koro iseti kendo yawuoti bende ok luw timbeni; omiyo koro yiernwa ruoth mondo otelnwa, machal gi mag ogendini mamoko mondo otelnwa.”<verse eid="1SA 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6"/>To kane gikwayo niya, “Miwa ruoth mondo otelnwa,” kwayoni ok ne omoro Samuel, omiyo nolamo Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7"/>To Jehova Nyasaye ne owachone niya, “Chik iti ne weche duto ma ji wachoni; nikech ok in ema gikwedi, to An ema gisekweda kaka ruodhgi. <verse eid="1SA 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8"/>Mana kaka gisebedo ka gitimo chakre ndalo mane agologi e piny Misri nyaka koroni, kagiweya kendo gitiyo ni nyiseche mamoko, ema koro in bende gitimoni. <verse eid="1SA 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9"/>Koro winj gima giwacho; makmana isiemgi matek, kendo mondo inyisgi mondo gingʼe gik ma ruoth mabiro ritogi biro timo.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10"/>Samuel nonyiso joma ne kwaye mondo omigi ruoth weche duto mag Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11"/>Nowacho niya, “Ma e gima ruoth mabiro ritou notim: Nokaw yawuotu mi noketgi mondo giti e gechene gi faresene, kendo giniringi e nyim gechene. <verse eid="1SA 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12"/>Moko to enoket jotelo mag lweny marito ji alufe alufe to moko motelo ni piero abich abich, moko nopur puothene gi dhok kendo kayo chambe, to bende moko noket mondo olos gige mag lweny to gi gik milosogo gechene. <verse eid="1SA 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13"/>Nokaw nyiwu mondo obed jolos modhi mangʼwe ngʼar to moko obed joted chiemo kod makati. <verse eid="1SA 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14"/>Enokaw puotheu mabeyo moloyo gi puotheu mag olembe mag mzabibu gi zeituni mi enomi jotichne. <verse eid="1SA 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15"/>Enokaw achiel kuom apar mag chambu gi olembeu mi nomigi jotende gi jotije. <verse eid="1SA 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16"/>Nomau jotiju machwo gi ma nyiri, kaachiel gi jambu mabeyo moloyo, kod pundeu nokawgi mondo giti tijene owuon. <verse eid="1SA 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17"/>Nokaw achiel kuom apar mag jambu kendo un uwegi unubed wasumbinige. <verse eid="1SA 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18"/>Ka odiechiengno ochopo, unuywagi ka ukwayo kony kuom ruoth mane uyiero, to Jehova Nyasaye ok nomiu dwoko.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19"/>To ji nodagi winjo Samuel mi negiwacho niya, “Ngangʼ! Wan to wadwaro ruoth mondo oritwa. <verse eid="1SA 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20"/>Mondo wan bende wabed machal gi ogendini mamoko, ka wan gi ruoth matelo nyimwa ka wadhi e lweny.”<verse eid="1SA 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21"/>Kane Samuel owinjo weche duto mane ji owacho, ne onyiso Jehova Nyasaye wechego mana kaka ne gikwayo. <verse eid="1SA 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22"/>Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko niya, “Winj gima giwachoni kendo imigi ruoth.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 8:22">Eka Samuel nowachone jo-Israel niya, “Koro ngʼato ka ngʼato odog e miechgi.”<verse eid="1SA 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Samuel owiro Saulo mondo obed Ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1"/>Ne nitie ja-Benjamin moro mongʼere ma nyinge Kish wuod Abiel, ma wuod Zeror, ma wuod Bekorath, ma wuod Afia ma ja-Benjamin. <verse eid="1SA 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2"/>Ne en gi wuowi miluongo ni Saulo, ne en rawera ma jaber e kind jo-Israel bende ne en rabora ma ji moko ne rem mana e goke.<verse eid="1SA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3"/>Chiengʼ moro punde mag Kish wuon Saulo nolal kendo Kish nowachone wuode ma Saulo niya, “Kaw achiel kuom jotich mondo udhigo udwar punde.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4"/>Omiyo nokadho e piny got mar Efraim kod alwora mar Shalisha, to ok ne giyudogi. Negidhiyo ma gichopo e gwenge mag Shaalim, to punde ne onge kuondego. Eka nokadho e piny Benjamin, to ne ok giyudogi.<verse eid="1SA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5"/>Kane gichopo e gwenge mag Zuf, Saulo nowachone jatich mane ni kode niya, “Bi wadogi, dipo ka wuora oweyo paro punde kendo mochako mana parowa.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6"/>To jatich nodwoke kawachone niya, “Iwinjo, e dalano nitiere ngʼat Nyasaye moro marahuma kendo gik mowacho duto timore mana kaka owacho. Bi wadhi ire koro nikech onyalo nyisowa yo monego waluw.”<verse eid="1SA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7"/>Saulo nowachone jatich niya, “To ka wadhi, en angʼo ma wabiro miyo ngʼatni? Chiemo mane ni e mifukewa oserumo. Waonge kod mich ma wanyalo tero ne ngʼat Nyasaye. En angʼo ma wan-go?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8"/>Jatich nowachone kendo niya, “An-gi pesa moko manok. Abiro miye ngʼat Nyasaye mondo onyiswa yo monego waluw.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9"/>Chon e piny Israel kane ngʼato dhi penjo Nyasaye wach ne owacho niya, “Bi wadhi ka Janen,” nikech ngʼat miluongo ni janabi ndaloni ne iluongo ni janen.<verse eid="1SA 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10"/>Saulo nowachone jatich niya, “Mano ber, bi wadhi.” Omiyo negiwuok ma gidhi e dala kama ngʼat Nyasaye nodakie.<verse eid="1SA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11"/>Kane giidho got matin-no ka gichomo dalano negiromo gi nyiri moko kadhi umbo pi kendo ne gipenjogi niya, “Bende ngʼat makoro nika?”<verse eid="1SA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12"/>To negidwoko niya, “Ee entie, ero odhi nyimu kanyo, returu. Koro eka odonjo e dalawa kawuono nimar jowa timo misango e kama owal.” <verse eid="1SA 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13"/>E sa ma usedonjo e dala to ubiro yudo kapok oidho odhi malo kama owal mondo ochiem. Ji ok bi chako chiemo nyaka ochopi, nikech nyaka ogwedh gir timo misango eka bangʼe jomo oluongi nyalo chiemo. Returu mapiyo sani ema unyalo yude.<verse eid="1SA 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14"/>Ne giwuotho mi gidhi nyaka dala, to kane gidonjo kanyo to negineno Samuel, kabiro gwenyore kodgi kochiko kama owal.<verse eid="1SA 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15"/>To chiengʼ motelone biro mar Saulo, noyudo ka Jehova Nyasaye osefwenyo ma ne Samuel. <verse eid="1SA 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16"/>“Kiny kar sa ma kama abiro oro ngʼato moa e piny Benjamin. Wire mondo otel ne joga ma jo-Israel, enores joga e lwet jo-Filistia. Asekecho joga nimar ywakgi osechopona.”<verse eid="1SA 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17"/>Kane Samuel ogoyo wangʼe kuom Saulo, Jehova Nyasaye ne owachone niya, “Ma e ngʼat mane awuoyoni kuome nibiro rito ogandana.”<verse eid="1SA 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18"/>Saulo nodhi ir Samuel e dhorangach mopenje niya, “Kiyie to nyisa od janen?”<verse eid="1SA 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19"/>Samuel nodwoke niya, “An e janen. Tel nyima idhi kama owal maler nimar kawuono ibiro chiemo koda kendo kiny gokinyi abiro weyi idhi kendo ananyisi mago duto man e chunyi. <verse eid="1SA 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20"/>Kor ka wach punde mane olal ndalo adek mokadho to owe chandi nimar oseyudgi. Koso en ngʼa ma chuny jo-Israel duto dwaro ka ok en in gi od wuonu?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21"/>Saulo nodwoko niya, “Donge an ja-Benjamin, oganda matin ahinya ei Israel, to donge dhoodwa bende e dhoot matin, moloyo ei oganda mar Benjamin? Angʼo momiyo iwacho wechegi kuoma?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22"/>Eka Samuel nokelo Saulo gi jatije kar budho moketogi gibet e kom manyime kuom ji duto mane oluongo mane nyalo romo ji piero adek. <verse eid="1SA 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23"/>Samuel ne onyiso jatedo niya, “Kel lemo mar ringʼo mane amiyi, mane anyisi ni iket tenge.”<verse eid="1SA 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24"/>Eka jatedo nokawo em gi sembe moketo e nyim Saulo. Samuel nowacho niya, “Ma e gima nokan-ni, cham, nikech nokan-nigo ne nyasini, chakre e kinde mane aluongoe welo.” Eka Saulo nochiemo gi Samuel chiengʼno.<verse eid="1SA 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25"/>Kane gisea e kama owal mi gidwogo e dala, Samuel nowuoyo gi Saulo ka gin kode ewi ode malo. <verse eid="1SA 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26"/>Ne gichiewo ka piny yawore, eka Samuel noluongo Saulo ewi ot, kowachone niya, “Ikri abiro gonyi mondo ichak wuodhi.” Kane Saulo oseikore, en kod Samuel ne giwuok oko. <verse eid="1SA 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27"/>Kane oyudo gin e bath dala, Samuel nowachone Saulo niya, “Nyis jatichni mondo otel, in to dongʼ chien mondo amiyi wach moa kuom Nyasaye.” Omiyo jatijno notimo kamano.<verse eid="1SA 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1"/>Eka Samuel nokawo tungʼ mar mo mi oolo ewi Saulo eka nonyodhe mowacho niya, “Donge Jehova Nyasaye osewiri mondo ibed jatelo ne joge moyiero. <verse eid="1SA 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2"/>Kawuononi ka iseweya ibiro romo gi ji ariyo machiegni gi liend Rael e gwengʼ Zelza e tongʼ jo-Benjamin. Gibiro wachoni ni, ‘Punde mane iwuok idhi dwaro oseyudi. Kendo wuonu oseweyo parogi koro chunye chandore ni wachne kopenjo niya, “Abiro timo angʼo ne wach wuodani?” ’<verse eid="1SA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3"/>“Eka ibiro wuok kanyo midhi nyaka yath maduongʼ man Tabor. Ji adek mawuotho kadhi Bethel ir Nyasaye norom kodi kanyo. Achiel kuomgi biro biro kotingʼo nyidiek adek, to machielo biro tingʼo makati adek, to machielo to otingʼo ndede mar divai. <verse eid="1SA 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4"/>Gibiro mosi kendo miyi makati ariyo, mibiro kawo kuomgi.<verse eid="1SA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5"/>“Bangʼ mano ibiro dhi Gibea miluongo ni Got mar Nyasaye kama nitie kambi mar jo-Filistia. Ka ichopo machiegni gi dala to ibiro romo gi oganda jonabi kalor koa kar lemo kotelnegi gi joma goyo orutu, gi tamborin, asili gi nyatiti, kendo jonabi biro biro ka gikoro wach. <verse eid="1SA 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6"/>Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nobi kuomi gi teko, inikor kaachiel kodgi kendo noloki mibed ngʼato mopogore. <verse eid="1SA 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7"/>Ka ranyisi otimore to mondo itim atima gima lweti oyudo ni onego tim; nikech Nyasaye ni kodi.<verse eid="1SA 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8"/>“Tel nyima idhi Gilgal. Chutho abiro lor ka abiro iri mondo atim misango miwangʼo pep kod misengini mag lalruok, to nyaka ine ni irita kuom ndalo abiriyo mondo abi anyisi gima onego itim.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oket Saulo ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9"/>Kane Saulo oseweyo Samuel, Nyasaye ne oloko chuny Saulo, kendo ranyisi duto nochopo kare chiengʼno. <verse eid="1SA 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10"/>Kane gichopo Gibea, oganda mar jonabi noromone, Roho mar Nyasaye nobiro mopongʼe gi teko eka nochako koro wach kodgi. <verse eid="1SA 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11"/>Eka joma ne ongʼeye kane onene ka okoro gi jonabi, negipenjore kendgi niya, “Ma to en angʼo matimore ne wuod Kish? Saulo bende en achiel kuom jonabi?”<verse eid="1SA 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12"/>To ngʼat moro modak e gwengʼno nomedo dwoko kopenjo niya, “Wuon-gi to en ngʼa?” Omiyo wachni nolokore ngero niya, “Saulo-ni bende en achiel kuom jonabi?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13"/>Kane Saulo osetieko koro noidho mobet e kar lemo.<verse eid="1SA 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14"/>Eka owad gi wuon Saulo nopenjogi niya, “Ne pod un kanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Ne odwoko niya, “Ne wadwaro punde, to kane waneno ni gitamowa yudo eka wadhi ir Samuel.”<verse eid="1SA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15"/>Owad gi wuon Saulo nowachone niya, “Nyisa gima Samuel nowachonu.”<verse eid="1SA 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16"/>Saulo nodwoke niya, “Ne owachonwa malongʼo ni punde ne oseyudo.” To ne ok onyise gima Samuel ne owacho kuom wach bedo ruoth.<verse eid="1SA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17"/>Samuel noluongo oganda jo-Israel duto Mizpa e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, <verse eid="1SA 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18"/>mowachonegi niya, “Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel wacho: ‘Ne agolo Israel koa Misri, kendo ne aresou e teko mar loch Misri kod pinjeruodhi duto mane thirou.’ <verse eid="1SA 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19"/>To koro useweyo Nyasachu, ma resou e masicheu gi chandruoku. Ma usewacho ni, ‘Ooyo miwa ruodhwa.’ Omiyo sani suduru e nyim Jehova Nyasaye kuchanoru e ogandau kod e dhoutu.”<verse eid="1SA 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20"/>Kane Samuel okelo ogendini duto mag Israel machiegni, to oganda mar Benjamin ema ne oyier. <verse eid="1SA 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21"/>Eka nokelo oganda mar Benjamin nyime, kaluwore gi dhoot ka dhoot, mine oyier dhood Matri. Mogik ne oyier Saulo wuod Kish. To kane gidware, to ne ok oyude. <verse eid="1SA 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22"/>Eka negimedo penjo wach kuom Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Ngʼatni bende osebiro ka koso?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Kendo Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko niya, “Ee, osepondo e kind misike.”<verse eid="1SA 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23"/>Negiringo ma giome, kane ochungʼ e dier oganda to ne obor ma ji moko ne gik mana e goke. <verse eid="1SA 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24"/>Samuel nowachone ji duto niya, “Bende uneno ngʼat ma Jehova Nyasaye oseyiero? Onge ngʼama chalo kode kuom ji duto.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Eka ji nokok niya, “Ruoth mondo odag amingʼa!”<verse eid="1SA 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25"/>Samuel nolero ne ji chike mag bedo ruoth. Nondikogi e kitabu mokano e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. Eka Samuel ne ogonyo ji mondo ngʼato ka ngʼato odog e dalane.<verse eid="1SA 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26"/>Saulo bende nodhi dalagi man Gibea, ka en gi joma thuondi mane osemul chunygi gi Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27"/>To jomoko ma acheje nowacho niya, “Ere kaka ngʼatni nyalo resowa?” Negi chaye mine ok gikelone mich. To Saulo nolingʼ mos.<verse eid="1SA 10:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Saulo oreso Dala Maduongʼ mar Jabesh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1"/>Nahash ja-Amon nodhi malo momonjo Jabesh Gilead. Eka joma chwo man Jabesh Gilead nowachone niya, “Tim winjruok kodwa to wabiro bedo wasumbini magi.”<verse eid="1SA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2"/>To Nahash ja-Amon nodwoko niya, “Abiro timo winjruok kodu mana ka uyie ni agolo wengeu ma korachwich kuom ngʼato ka ngʼato mondo akuodgo wi Israel duto.”<verse eid="1SA 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3"/>Eka jodong Jabesh nowachone niya, “Miwa ndalo abiriyo mondo waor joote e piny Israel duto kaonge ngʼama oyie biro konyowa to wabiro chiwore e lweti.”<verse eid="1SA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4"/>Kane joote otundo Gibea dalagi Saulo mi ginyiso ji wechego, giduto ne giywak matek. <verse eid="1SA 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5"/>E sechego noyudo Saulo duogo koa e puodho ka owuotho bangʼ rwethe eka nopenjo ni, Angʼo marach gi ji? Angʼo momiyo giywak? Eka negiwachone kendo weche mane jo-jabesh owacho.<verse eid="1SA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6"/>Kane Saulo owinjo wechegi, Roho mar Nyasaye nobiro kuome gi teko, mi iye nowangʼ ahinya. <verse eid="1SA 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7"/>Ne okawo rwedhi ariyo mag pur mi oyangʼo mi opogo ringʼo lemo lemo, eka nooro joote gi ringʼogi e piny Israel duto, kowacho niya, “Ma e gima ibiro timne rweth ngʼat modagi luwo bangʼ Saulo gi Samuel.” Eka luoro mar Jehova Nyasaye ne omako ji mine giwuok gi chuny achiel. <verse eid="1SA 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8"/>Kane Saulo okwanogi Bezek, jo-Israel ne oromo alufu mia adek to jo-Juda ne oromo alufu piero adek.<verse eid="1SA 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9"/>Neginyiso joote mane obiro niya, “Wachneuru jo-Jabesh Gilead ni, ‘E sa ma chiengʼ oore, enoresu.’ ” Kane joote odwoko ne jo-Jabesh wachni negimor. <verse eid="1SA 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10"/>Eka neginyiso jo-Amon niya, “Kiny wanachiwre e lwetu kendo unutimnwa gima uneno ni bernu.”<verse eid="1SA 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11"/>Kinyne Saulo nopogo joge e migepe adek; kane ochopo kogwen eka negidonjo e kambi mar jo-Amon mi ginegogi nyaka chiengʼ obet makech. Jogo mane otony ne oke maonge ji ariyo mane owe kawuotho kaachiel.<verse eid="1SA 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Owal Saulo bedo ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12"/>Eka ji nowachone Samuel niya, “Ngʼa gini mane penjo ni, ‘Bende Saulo dibed ruodhwa?’ Kelnwagi mondo waneg-gi.”<verse eid="1SA 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13"/>To Saulo nowacho niya, “Onge ngʼama inego kawuono nikech kawuono Jehova Nyasaye osereso Israel.”<verse eid="1SA 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14"/>Eka Samuel ne owacho ne ji niya, “Biuru wadhi Gilgal kendo kuno wadhi guro loch Saulo.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15"/>Omiyo ji duto nodhi Gilgal kendo negiguro Saulo kaka ruoth e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. Kuno ne gichiwoe misengini mag lalruok e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, kendo Saulo kod Israel noloso budho malich ahinya.<verse eid="1SA 11:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Twak ma Samuel ogoyogo oriti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1"/>Samuel nowachone jo-Israel duto niya, “Asewinjo gik moko duto ma usewachona kendo koro asemiyou ruoth. <verse eid="1SA 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2"/>Koro un kod ruoth kaka jatendu. Anto aseti ma wiya oti lwar, kendo yawuota un-go ka. Asebedo jatendu chakre tin-na nyaka sani. <verse eid="1SA 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3"/>Eri achungʼ ka. Hulieuru e nyim Jehova Nyasaye kod ngʼate mowir ketho ma asetimo. Rwadh ngʼa masekawo? Punda ngʼa masekawo? Ngʼatno ma asethiro? Asekawo asoya koa kuom ngʼa mondo odin wangʼa? Ka dipo ni asetimo achiel kuom gigi, to aikora mar loso.”<verse eid="1SA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4"/>Negidwoko niya, “Pok iwuondowa kata thirowa. Bende pok ikawo gimoro amora moa e lwet ngʼato.”<verse eid="1SA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5"/>Samuel nowachonegi niya, “Jehova Nyasaye en janeno kuomu, kendo ngʼate mowir bende obedo janeno kawuononi, ni ok useyudo gimoro e lweta.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Negiwacho niya, “Adier, en janeno.”<verse eid="1SA 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6"/>Eka Samuel nowachone ji niya, “Jehova Nyasaye ema ne oyiero Musa gi Harun kendo nogolo kwereu koa e piny Misri. <verse eid="1SA 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7"/>Koro sani, chungʼuru ka, mondo anyisu ratiro kendo aparnu e nyim Jehova Nyasaye timbe duto makare mane otimonu kaachiel gi wuoneu.<verse eid="1SA 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8"/>“Kane Jakobo odonjo e piny Misri, ne giywakne Jehova Nyasaye mondo okonygi, kendo Jehova Nyasaye ne ooro Musa gi Harun, mane ogolo kwereu owuok oa Misri mi oketogi kama gidakieni.<verse eid="1SA 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9"/>“To wigi nowil gi Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachgi; omiyo nojwangʼogi e lwet Sisera, jatend lweny mar Hazor, kendo e lwet jo-Filistia gi ruodh Moab mane okedo kodgi. <verse eid="1SA 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10"/>Ne giywakne Jehova Nyasaye kagiwacho niya, ‘Wasetimo richo, waseweyo Jehova Nyasaye mi watiyo ne nyiseche mag Baal gi Ashtoreth. To koro sani reswa e lwet wasikwa mi wanatini.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11"/>Eka Jehova Nyasaye ne ooro Jerub-Baal (ma bende iluongo ni Gideon), Barak (ma bende iluongo ni Bedan), Jeftha gi Samuel, kendo ne oresou kuom wasiku mane omonjou koa koni gi koni, momiyo udak gi kwe.<verse eid="1SA 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12"/>“To kane uneno ka Nahash ruodh jo-Amon dwaro monjou, ne uwachona ni, ‘Nyaka wabed gi ruoth ma ritowa,’ kata obedo ni Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu ne en ruodhu. <verse eid="1SA 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13"/>Koro neuru ma e ruoth ma useyiero, mane ukwayo; omiyo Jehova Nyasaye oseketo ruoth mondo oritu. <verse eid="1SA 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14"/>Ka umiyo Jehova Nyasaye luor kendo kutiyone, ka uwinjo chikne kendo ok ungʼanyone chikene, un kaachiel gi ruodhu ma ritou mi uluwo Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu, to mano ber. <verse eid="1SA 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15"/>To ka utamoru winjo Jehova Nyasaye, mi ungʼanyone chikene, to enokumu kaka ne okumo kwereu.<verse eid="1SA 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16"/>“Koro sani chungʼuru kar tiendu mondo une hono maduongʼ ma Jehova Nyasaye timo mana ka uneno! <verse eid="1SA 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17"/>Donge sani en ndalo mikayoe ngano? Abiro luongo Jehova Nyasaye mondo okel polo mamor gi koth. Eka ubiro ngʼeyo ni usetimo marach e wangʼ Jehova Nyasaye kuom kwayou mane upenjogo ruoth.”<verse eid="1SA 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18"/>Eka Samuel noluongo Jehova Nyasaye, kendo mana gi odiechiengʼno Jehova Nyasaye nokelo mor polo gi koth. Omiyo ji duto nochungʼ ka luoro omakogi e nyim Jehova Nyasaye kod Samuel.<verse eid="1SA 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19"/>Eka ji duto nowachone Samuel niya, “Lam Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi ni jotichni mondo kik watho, nimar wasemedo ewi richowa mamoko tim marach mar kwayo mondo miwa ruoth.”<verse eid="1SA 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20"/>Samuel nodwokogi niya, “Kik ubed maluor. Kata obedo ni usetimo tim marachni, koro kik ulokru uwe Jehova Nyasaye, to tineuru gi chunyu duto. <verse eid="1SA 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21"/>Kik ulokru uluw nyiseche manono. Ok ginyal konyou, bende ok ginyal resou nikech gin gik manono. <verse eid="1SA 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22"/>Nikech nyinge maduongʼ, Jehova Nyasaye ok nojwangʼ joge, nikech Jehova Nyasaye ne mor mar timou joge owuon. <verse eid="1SA 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23"/>Kata kamano, anto ok anyal ketho ni Jehova Nyasaye kuom weyo ma ok alemonu. To abiro puonjou yo maber kendo makare. <verse eid="1SA 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24"/>Un to nyaka une ni uluoru Jehova Nyasaye, kendo utine gi adieri gi chunyu duto; parieuru gigo madongo mosetimonu. <verse eid="1SA 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25"/>To ka usiko ka utimo marach, to un kaachiel gi ruodhu ibiro tieku.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Samuel okwero Saulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1"/>Saulo ne ja-higni piero adek kane ochako bedo ruoth kendo nobedo ruodh Israel kuom higni piero angʼwen gariyo.<verse eid="1SA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2"/>Saulo noyiero ji alufu adek kuom jo-Israel; to kuom joma noyierogo ji alufu ariyo ne ni kode Mikmash gi pinje gode mag Bethel, to ji alufu achiel ne nigi Jonathan e gwengʼ Gibea e piny Benjamin. To ji duto modongʼ nonyiso nodog miechgi.<verse eid="1SA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3"/>Jonathan nomonjo kambi man Geba mar jolwenj jo-Filistia kendo jo-Filistia nowinjo wachno. Eka Saulo nochiko mondo ogo tungʼ e piny duto mi owacho niya, “We jo-Hibrania owinji!” <verse eid="1SA 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4"/>Omiyo jo-Israel duto nowinjo wach ni Saulo osemonjo kambi jo-Filistia kendo koro jo-Filistia oselo gi jo-Israel. Mine oluong ji mondo odhi ir Saulo Gilgal.<verse eid="1SA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5"/>Jo-Filistia nochokore mar kedo gi jo-Israel, ka gin gi geche alufu adek, gi geche mag farese alufu auchiel, gi jolweny mathoth ka kwoyo man e dho nam. Negiwuok mi gidhi gibworo Mikmash man yo wuok chiengʼ mar Beth Aven. <verse eid="1SA 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6"/>Kane jo-Israel oneno kaka wach chal kuomgi kendo ni jolwenjgi othungʼ marach, ne gipondo e rogo, e bunge, e kind lwendni, e buche matut, e soko. <verse eid="1SA 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7"/>Jo-Hibrania moko nongʼado aora Jordan modhi e piny Gad gi Gilead.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Saulo to nodongʼ Gilgal, to jolwenje mane ni kode ne tetni ka luoro omakogi. <verse eid="1SA 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8"/>Norito Samuel kuom ndalo abiriyo kaka Samuel nosechiko, to Samuel ne ok obiro Gilgal kendo joma ne nigi Saulo nochako ke. <verse eid="1SA 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9"/>Omiyo nowacho niya, “Kelnauru gima itimogo misango miwangʼo pep kod misango mar lalruok.” Kendo Saulo nochiwo misango miwangʼo pep. <verse eid="1SA 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10"/>E sa ma ne otieko chiwo misangono, Samuel nochopo kendo Saulo nodhi mondo omose.<verse eid="1SA 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11"/>Samuel nopenje niya, “Angʼo misetimoni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Saulo nodwoke niya, “Kane aneno ka ji ke to in bende pok ibiro e sa mane oketi, to jo-Filistia bende chokore Mikmash, <verse eid="1SA 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12"/>ne aparo ni, ‘Koro jo-Filistia biro monja Gilgal, ka pod ok apenjo kendo pod ok akwayo Jehova Nyasaye mondo okonya.’ Omiyo ne aneno ni ochuna ni nyaka achiw misango miwangʼo pep.”<verse eid="1SA 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13"/>Samuel nowachone niya, “Isetimo tim mofuwo. Ok iserito chik mane Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi omiyi; ka dine iriti, to doguro pinyruodhi e Israel nyaka chiengʼ. <verse eid="1SA 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14"/>To koro pinyruodhi ok bi siko, Jehova Nyasaye oseyudo ngʼat ma chunye chal gi mare kendo osekete, mondo otel ne joge, nikech in ok iserito chik mar Jehova Nyasaye.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15"/>Eka Samuel noa Gilgal modhi Gibea e piny Benjamin, kendo Saulo nokwano joma ne ni kode mine oyudo ni gin ji madirom mia auchiel.<verse eid="1SA 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo-Israel onge gi gige lweny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16"/>Saulo gi wuode Jonathan kod ji mane ni kodgi nobet Gibea e piny Benjamin, to jo-Filistia nojot Mikmash. <verse eid="1SA 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17"/>Sidienje adek mag jolwenj jo-Filistia nowuok e kambi margi, migawo mokwongo nodhi momonjo jo-Ofra e piny Shual, <verse eid="1SA 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18"/>to machielo nochiko Beth Horon mar adek nodhi e tongʼ mochiko Holo mar Zeboim mochimo kuma otimo ongoro.<verse eid="1SA 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19"/>Ne onge jotheth e piny Israel mangima nikech jo-Filistia nosewacho niya, “Ka kamano to jo-Hibrania biro loso ligengini kod tonge!” <verse eid="1SA 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20"/>Omiyo jo-Israel duto ne odhi e piny jo-Filistia mondo opiag kuegi, saruru, ledhi kod musmeno mar ngʼado lum. <verse eid="1SA 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21"/>Nengo mar piago kwer gi saruru ne en ariyo ewi adek mar Shekel, nengo mar piago uma gi le ne en achiel ewi adek mar Shekel, kata mar rieyo bidhi.<verse eid="1SA 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22"/>Omiyo chiengʼ lweny onge jalweny moro amora mane nigi Saulo kod Jonathan mane nigi ligangla kata tongʼ e lwete; makmana Saulo gi Jonathan kende ema ne ni kod ligangla gi tongʼ.<verse eid="1SA 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jonathan omonjo jo-Filistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23"/>Koro jolwenj jo-Filistia nosekadho modhi Mikmash.<verse eid="1SA 13:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1"/>Chiengʼ moro achiel Jonathan wuod Saulo nowachone wuowi mane tingʼone gige lweny niya, “Bi mondo wadhi loka cha e kambi mar jo-Filistia.” To ne ok onyiso wuon-gi.<verse eid="1SA 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2"/>Noyudo Saulo ojot oko mar Gibea e tiend yadh moro man-gi olemo mongʼinore e Migron. Ji madirom mia auchiel ne ni kode kuno, <verse eid="1SA 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3"/>achiel kuom joma ne en godo kuno ne en Ahija mane orwako law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod. Ne en wuod owadgi Ikabod miluongo ni Ahitub wuod Finehas, ma wuod Eli, jadolo mar Jehova Nyasaye modak Shilo. Ne onge ngʼama ongʼeyo ni Jonathan ne osewuok.<verse eid="1SA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4"/>E dire koni gi kocha kuma ne Jonathan dwa ngʼado eka ochop e kambi jo-Filistia ne nitie geng got miluongo ni Bozez, to komachielo ne iluongo ni Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5"/>Geng got achiel ne ni yo nyandwat mane omanyore gi Mikmash, to machielo ne ni yo milambo momanyore gi Geba.<verse eid="1SA 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6"/>Jonathan ne owacho ne wuowi matingʼo gige lwenje niya, “Bi mondo waidh wadhi e kambi joma ok oter nyangugi. Kamoro dipo ka Jehova Nyasaye nyalo tiyo kodwa. Onge gima nyalo tamo Jehova Nyasaye reso kata ka gin ji mangʼeny kata ka gin ji manok.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7"/>Jatingʼ gige lwenje nodwoke niya, “Tim atima gima ni e chunyi nikech an chunya gi pacha ni kodi.”<verse eid="1SA 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8"/>Jonathan nowachone niya, “Koro bi, wangʼad wadhi irgi mondo omi ginewa. <verse eid="1SA 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9"/>Ka giwachonwa ni, ‘Rituru kanyo nyaka wabi iru,’ to wabiro chungʼ achungʼa kama wantie kendo ok wanadhi irgi. <verse eid="1SA 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10"/>To kagiwacho ni, ‘Biuru irwa,’ to wabiro idho malo, nikech mano biro bedonwa ranyisi ni Jehova Nyasaye oseketogi e lwetwa.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11"/>Omiyo giduto ji ariyogo ne giwuok e lela mondo jo-Filistia manie kambigi onegi. Eka jo-Filistia nowacho niya, “Neuru! Jo-Hibrania mol kawuok ae buche mane gipondoe.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12"/>Eka ji duto mane ni e kambi nokok ni Jonathan gi jatingʼne gi lwenje niya, “Biuru irwa mondo une gima wabiro timonu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Omiyo Jonathan nowacho ni jatingʼ gi lwenje niya, “Idh iluwa Jehova Nyasaye oseketogi e lwet jo-Israel.”<verse eid="1SA 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13"/>Jonathan ne idho got kokonyore gi lwetene gi tiendene, to jatingʼ gige lwenje luwo bangʼe. Jo-Filistia nopodho e nyim Jonathan, ka jatingʼ gige lwenje luwo bangʼe kendo negogi. <verse eid="1SA 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14"/>E kedo mokwongono Jonathan kaachiel gi jatingʼ gige lwenjene nonego ji piero ariyo e alwora mar nus heka.<verse eid="1SA 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo-Israel oloyo jo-Filistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15"/>Bwok maduongʼ nomako jolweny mane ni e kambi gi mago mane ni e paw lweny, kata mana mago mane ni e kambi matindo tindo kendo piny duto noyiengni. Ne en kihondko moor gi Nyasaye.<verse eid="1SA 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16"/>Jorito mag Saulo mane ni Gibea ei Benjamin noneno ka jolweny jo-Filistia ringo koni gi koni. <verse eid="1SA 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17"/>Saulo nonyiso joma ne ni kode niya kwanreuru mondo une ni ngʼatno mosewuok e dierwa ka, kane gisetimo kamano negiyudo ni en Jonathan gi jatingʼ gige lwenje ema onge kanyo.<verse eid="1SA 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18"/>Saulo nowachone Ahija ni kel Sandug Muma mar Nyasaye mane jo-Israel nigo e kindeno. <verse eid="1SA 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19"/>Kane Saulo pod wuoyo gi jadolo, to mahu mane ni e kambi jo-Filistia ne medore ameda. Omiyo Saulo nowachone jadolo niya, “Gol lweti ewi Sandug Muma.”<verse eid="1SA 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20"/>Eka Saulo gi joge nochokore mi gidhi e lweny. Negiyudo ka jo-Filistia pachgi ok ti, kendo gingʼadore gi ligangla kendgi giwegi. <verse eid="1SA 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21"/>Jo-Hibrania mane oyudo konyo jo-Filistia kedo mane ni kodgi e kambi, nodok ir jo-Israel mane nigi Saulo gi Jonathan. <verse eid="1SA 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22"/>Kane jo-Israel duto mane oyudo opondo e piny gode man Efraim owinjo ni jo-Filistia ringo, negidonjo e lweny kendo ne gilawogi matek. <verse eid="1SA 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23"/>Omiyo Jehova Nyasaye ne oreso jo-Israel chiengʼno, eka lweny nosudo mokadho Beth Aven.<verse eid="1SA 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jonathan chamo mor kich</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24"/>Koro jo-Israel ne ool ahinya odiechiengno, nikech Saulo ne oketogi ma gikwongʼore ka owacho niya, “Okwongʼ ngʼato angʼata machiemo ka piny pok oyuso, kapok achulo kuor ni wasika!” Omiyo onge ngʼama nobilo chiemo.<verse eid="1SA 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25"/>To jolweny duto ne odonjo ei bungu to ne nitie mor kich piny. <verse eid="1SA 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26"/>Kane gidhi e bungu negineno mor kich ka chwer piny, to kata kamano onge ngʼama ne otero lwete mondo otere e dhoge, nikech negiluoro kwongʼ. <verse eid="1SA 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27"/>Jonathan to ne ok owinjo ni wuon ne ose kwero ji gi kwongʼ, omiyo nochwowo pedni mar kich gi luth mane ni e lwete. Notingʼo lwete malo motero mor kich e dhoge mi chunye ne odwogo. <verse eid="1SA 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28"/>Eka achiel kuom jolweny nowachone niya, “Wuoru nokwero jolweny matek gi kwongʼ kowacho ni, ‘Okwongʼ ngʼama ochamo chiemo kawuono! Mano ema omiyo ji ool.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29"/>Jonathan nowacho niya, “Wuora osekelo chandruok ne piny. Ne kaka koro Awinjo maber bangʼ bilo mor kich matin. <verse eid="1SA 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30"/>Dine obedo maber manade ka dine ji ochamo gik mamoko moyaki kuom wasigu kawuono. Donge dine wanego jo-Filistia mangʼeny?”<verse eid="1SA 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31"/>E odiechiengno, bangʼ ka jo-Israel noseloyo jo-Filistia ne gilawogi koa Mikmash nyaka Aijalon kendo ne giol ahinya. <verse eid="1SA 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32"/>Negimuomore kuom gik moyaki, mine gikawo rombe, dhok, gi nyiroye, negiketogi piny migi yangʼogi kendo chamogi ka gitimo remo. <verse eid="1SA 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33"/>Eka ngʼato nowachone Saulo niya, “Neye kaka ji timo richo ni Jehova Nyasaye ka gichamo ringʼo motimo remo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Eka nowacho niya, “Useketho yie. Ngʼielnauru kidi maduongʼno ukel ka.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34"/>Eka nowacho niya, “Dhiuru ir oganda kendo unyisgi ni, ‘Ngʼato ka ngʼato kuomu mondo okelna dhogene kod rombege, kendo oneg-gi ka mi uchamgi. Kik utim richo ne Jehova Nyasaye kuom chamo ringʼo motimo remo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:34">Omiyo ngʼato ka ngʼato ne okelo rwadhe otienono mine giyangʼogi kanyo. <verse eid="1SA 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35"/>Eka Saulo nogero kendo mar misango ne Jehova Nyasaye, mano e chiengʼ mokwongo mane otime ma.<verse eid="1SA 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36"/>Saulo nowacho niya, “Wadhiuru mwalo mondo walaw jo-Filistia gotieno, mondo watiekgi nyaka kogwen kendo moro amora kuomgi kik dongʼ kangima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Negidwoko niya, “Tim gima ineno ni berni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">To jadolo nowacho niya, “Wapenjuru Nyasaye wach mondi.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37"/>Omiyo Saulo nopenjo Nyasaye niya, “Bende anyalo lawo jo-Filistia? Ibiro ketogi e lwet jo-Israel koso?” To Nyasaye ne ok odwoke chiengʼno.<verse eid="1SA 14:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38"/>Saulo nowacho niya, “Biuru ka, un duto ma un jotelo mag jolweny, mondo wayud ni richo mane mosetim kawuono. <verse eid="1SA 14:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39"/>Adieri gi nying Jehova Nyasaye ma reso Israel, kata ka en wuoda Jonathan ema wachni omako to nyaka otho.” To onge ngʼat machielo mane owuoyo.<verse eid="1SA 14:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40"/>Saulo nowachone jo-Israel duto niya, “Un chungʼuru konchiel ka an kod Jonathan wuoda to wachungʼ bathe komachielo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Ji nodwoko niya, “Tim gima ineno ni berni.”<verse eid="1SA 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41"/>Bangʼe Saulo nolamo Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel niya, “En angʼo momiyo pod ok idwoko jatichni kawuono? Ka dipo ni iyudo ketho moro kuoma kata kuom wuoda Jonathan, to chiw ombulu miluongo ni Urim, to ka dipo ni jo-Israel ema oketho, ni chiw ombulu miluongo ni Thumim.” Omiyo Saulo gi Jonathan ema noyier gi ombulu, to jo-Israel nowe. <verse eid="1SA 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42"/>Saulo nowacho niya, “Gouru ombulu e kinda gi Jonathan wuoda.” Mi ombulu nolwar kuom Jonathan.<verse eid="1SA 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43"/>Eka Saulo nowacho ni Jonathan niya, “Wachna gima isetimo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Jonathan nowachone niya, “Ne abilo mor kich matin mane ni e dho ludha. Koro ochuno ni nyaka atho?”<verse eid="1SA 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44"/>Saulo nowacho niya, “Nyasaye mondo okweda, ka ok itho in Jonathan.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45"/>To ji nowachone Saulo niya, “Bende Jonathan ditho to en ema osekelo konyruok maduongʼ kama e Israel? Ok nyalre! Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni kata yie wiye achiel ok nolwar piny nikech Jehova Nyasaye ema okonye timo ma.” Kamano ji noreso Jonathan kendo ne ok onege.<verse eid="1SA 14:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46"/>Eka Saulo noweyo lawo jo-Filistia mine gidok thurgi.<verse eid="1SA 14:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47"/>Bangʼ ka Saulo nosekawo loch e piny Israel, nokedo gi wasikgi koni gi koni kaka jo-Moab, jo-Amon, jo-Edom, gi ruodhi mag Zoba to gi jo-Filistia. Kamoro amora mane odhiye ne osandogi. <verse eid="1SA 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48"/>Nokedo gi chir moloyo jo-Amalek, moreso jo-Israel oa e lwet joma nosebet ka yako gigegi.<verse eid="1SA 14:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jood Saulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49"/>Yawuot Saulo ne gin Jonathan, Ishvi, gi Malki-Shua. Nying nyare maduongʼ ne en Merab to nyako ma chogo ne nyinge Mikal. <verse eid="1SA 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50"/>Chiege ne nyinge Ahinoam nyar Ahimaz. Jatend jolweny ne Abner wuod Ner, Ner ne en owadgi wuon Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 14:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51"/>Wuon Saulo ma Kish gi wuon Abner ma wuon Ner ne yawuot Abiel.<verse eid="1SA 14:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52"/>E ndalo duto mag Saulo ne nitie lweny malit ahinya e kinde gi jo-Filistia, kendo kinde ma Saulo noneno ngʼat maratego kata mathuon to ne okawe mondo obed jalwenje.<verse eid="1SA 14:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Jehova Nyasaye odagi ni Saulo ok bed ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1"/>Samuel nowachone ne Saulo niya, “An ema Jehova Nyasaye noora mondo awiri ibed ruodh joge Israel; omiyo koro lingʼ iwinj wach moa kuom Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2"/>Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho: ‘Abiro kumo jo-Amalek kuom gima negitimo ni jo-Israel kaka ne gigengʼonegi e kinde mane gia Misri. <verse eid="1SA 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3"/>Koro dhiyo imonj jo-Amalek kendo itiek gimoro amora ma mekgi. Kik iwegi; neg chwo gi mon, gi rowere gi nyithindo madhoth, dhok, rombe, ngamia gi punde.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4"/>Omiyo Saulo noluongo joge Telaim mokwanogi kendo negiromo jolweny alufu mia ariyo mawuotho gi tiendegi to gi alufu apar moa Juda. <verse eid="1SA 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5"/>Saulo nodhi e dala maduongʼ mar jo-Amalek koikore monjogi e holo. <verse eid="1SA 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6"/>Eka nowachone jo-Keni niya, “Auru ka udhi mondo uwe jo-Amalek nikech ok adwar tiekou kodgi; nikech un ne utimo ngʼwono ni jo-Israel e kinde mane gia Misri.” Omiyo jo-Keni nowuok moweyo jo-Amalek.<verse eid="1SA 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7"/>Eka Saulo nokedo gi jo-Amalek kochakore Havila nyaka ochopo Shur to nyaka ochopo yo wuok chiengʼ mar Misri. <verse eid="1SA 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8"/>Nomako Agag ruoth jo-Amalek kangima to joge duto to nonego gi ligangla pep. <verse eid="1SA 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9"/>To Saulo gi jolweny noweyo Agag kod rombe mabeyo, gi dhok, gi nyiroye machwe gi nyirombe kod gimoro amora maber. Magi to ne ok giyie mondo oketh duto, to gimoro amora mane gichayo gi mago mayom yom to negitieko pep.<verse eid="1SA 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10"/>Eka wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ne Samuel kawacho niya, <verse eid="1SA 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11"/>“Akuyo nikech ne aketo Saulo obedo ruoth, nikech oseweyo luwa, kendo ok otimo kaka ne achike.” Samuel nochandore kendo noywak ne Jehova Nyasaye otieno mangima.<verse eid="1SA 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12"/>Samuel nochiew okinyi mangʼich kendo nodhi romo gi Saulo, mi nowachne niya, “Saulo osedhi Karmel. Kanyo osechungoe rapar mimiyego duongʼ kuno kendo osewuok kuno olor kodhi Gilgal.”<verse eid="1SA 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13"/>Kane Samuel obiro ire, Saulo nowachone niya, “Mad Jehova Nyasaye gwedhi! Asetimo duto mane Jehova Nyasaye ochika.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14"/>To Samuel nowachone niya, “Marangʼo awinjo ywak rombe gi dhok e ita?”<verse eid="1SA 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15"/>Saulo nodwoko niya, “Jolweny nokelogi koa kuom jo-Amalek; negiweyo rombe kod dhok mabeyo mondo gitimgo misango ni Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi, to modongʼ wanego pep.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16"/>Samuel nowachone Saulo niya, “Lingʼ thi! We mondo anyisi gima Jehova Nyasaye nowachona otieno mokalo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Saulo nodwoko niya, “Nyisawa.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17"/>Samuel nowachone niya, “Kata nobedo ni inenori ka ngʼama tin kamano, to donge ne ibedo jatelo mar dhout Israel? Jehova Nyasaye ne owiri mondo ibed ruodh Israel. <verse eid="1SA 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18"/>Kendo ne omiyi ote, kowacho ni, ‘Dhiyo mondo itiek chuth jo-Amalek marichogi; ked kodgi nyaka ine ni itiekogi pep.’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19"/>Angʼo momiyo ne ok iwinjo dwond Jehova Nyasaye? Angʼo momiyo ne imuomori mi iyeko kendo itimo richo e wangʼ Jehova Nyasaye?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20"/>Saulo nowacho niya, “To ne awinjo dwond Jehova Nyasaye ma atimo dwarone kendo atimo tich mane omiya mondo atim. Ne anego jo-Amalek pep kendo ne akawo Agag ruodhgi mi abirogo. <verse eid="1SA 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21"/>Jolweny nokawo rombe gi dhok kuom gik moyaki, gigo mabeyo nowal ne Nyasaye mondo otimnego Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi misango Gilgal.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22"/>Samuel nodwoke niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">“Iparo ni Jehova Nyasaye mor gi chiwo kod misengini miwangʼo pep</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">moloyo winjo dwonde?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Winjo wach ber moloyo chiwo misango</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">kendo chiko it ber moloyo boche imbe,<verse eid="1SA 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23"/>nimar ngʼanyo chal gi richo mar jwok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">to tok teko chalo gi richo mar lamo nyiseche manono.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">Nikech isedagi wach Jehova Nyasaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">En bende osedagi ni kik ibed ruoth.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24"/>Eka Saulo nowachone Samuel niya. “Asetimo richo. Asetamora luwo chik Jehova Nyasaye kod wecheni bende. Ne aluoro ji kendo ne atimo dwarogi. <verse eid="1SA 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25"/>Koro sani asayi ni iwena richona kendo wadog kodi mondo mi alam Jehova Nyasaye.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26"/>To Samuel nowachone niya, “Ok anyal dok kodi. Isedagi luwo wach Jehova Nyasaye, kuom mano Jehova Nyasaye bende osedagi ni kik ibed ruodh Israel!”<verse eid="1SA 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27"/>Kane Samuel ochako wuoth mondo odhi, Saulo nomako riak lawe, mi oyiech. <verse eid="1SA 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28"/>Samuel nowachone niya, “Jehova Nyasaye oseyiecho pinyruodh Israel kogole kuomi kawuononi kendo osemiye ja-libambau moro maber moloyi. <verse eid="1SA 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29"/>Jalno ma en Jehova Nyasaye Maduongʼ mar Israel ok riambi bende ok olok pache; nimar ok en dhano mondo olok pache.”<verse eid="1SA 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30"/>Saulo nodwoko niya, “Asetimo richo. To kiyie to miya luor e nyim jodong joga kendo e nyim jo-Israel; dog koda mondo mi alam Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi.” <verse eid="1SA 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31"/>Omiyo Samuel nodok gi Saulo, kendo Saulo nolamo Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="1SA 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32"/>Eka Samuel nowacho niya, “Kelna Agag ruodh jo-Amalek.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:32">Omiyo Agag nobiro ire ka en gi chir koparo e chunye niya, “Lit mar tho osekadho.”<verse eid="1SA 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33"/>To Samuel nowacho niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:33">“Kaka liganglani osemiyo mon owe maonge nyithindo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:33">e kaka minu nobed maonge nyathi e kind mon mamoko.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1SA 15:33">Eka Samuel nonego Agag e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, Gilgal.<verse eid="1SA 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34"/>Eka Samuel nowuok modhi Rama, to Saulo bende nodok dalane Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35"/>Nyaka chop odiechiengʼ mane Samuel othoe, ne ok ochako oneno Saulo kendo, kata obedo ni Samuel ne oywage kamano. Jehova Nyasaye ne okuyo nikech ne oketo Saulo obedo ruodh Israel.<verse eid="1SA 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Samuel owiro Daudi ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Samuel niya, “Ibiro kuyo ne wach Saulo nyaka karangʼo nikech asedage mondo kik obed ruodh Israel? Pongʼ tungʼ mari gi mo mondo ichak wuoth; aori ka Jesse ma ja-Bethlehem. Aseyiero achiel kuom yawuote mondo obed ruoth.”<verse eid="1SA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2"/>To Samuel nopenje niya, “Dadhi nade? Saulo biro winjo wachno to obiro nega.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Jehova Nyasaye nowacho niya, “Kaw nyaroya idhigo kendo iwachne ni abiro timo misango ne Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3"/>Luong Jesse e sawo mar misango, to abiro nyisi gima onego itim. Ibiro wirona ngʼat mabiro nyisi.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4"/>Samuel notimo gima Jehova Nyasaye nowacho. Kane ochopo Bethlehem, to jodong dala ne luoro omako kane giromo kode. Negipenje niya, “Bende ibiro e yor kwe?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5"/>Samuel nodwoko niya, “Ee, abiro e yor kwe. Asebiro mondo atim misango ni Jehova Nyasaye. Pwodhreuru mondo ubi e misango koda.” Eka nopwodho Jesse gi yawuote mi noluongogi e timo misangono.<verse eid="1SA 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6"/>Kane gichopo, Samuel noneno Eliab moparo niya, “Adier ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye mowiro eri ochungʼ ka e nyime.”<verse eid="1SA 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7"/>To Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Samuel niya, “Kik ingʼi ber mar dende kata borne nikech asedage. Jehova Nyasaye ok ngʼi gik ma dhano ngʼiyo. Dhano ngʼiyo ber ma oko, Jehova Nyasaye to ngʼiyo chuny.”<verse eid="1SA 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8"/>Eka Jesse noluongo Abinadab kendo nokete okadho e nyim Samuel. Samuel to nowacho niya, “Jehova Nyasaye ok oyiero kata ngʼatni.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9"/>Eka Jesse noketo Shama mondo okadhi, to Samuel nowacho niya, “Kata mana ngʼatni bende Jehova Nyasaye ok oyiero.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10"/>Jesse noketo yawuote abiriyo okadho e nyim Samuel mi Samuel nowachone ni onge ngʼama Jehova Nyasaye oseyiero kuomgi. <verse eid="1SA 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11"/>Omiyo nopenjo Jesse niya, “Magi kende e yawuoti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Jesse nodwoko niya, “Pod nitiere wuowi ma chogo, en to okwayo rombe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Samuel nowachone niya, “Or ngʼato mondo oome, nikech ok wabi bet piny ka kapok ochopo.”<verse eid="1SA 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12"/>Ne ooro jaote mine okele. Ne en silwal man-gi ngima maber, ne dende nenore maber kendo ne en jachia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:12">Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowacho niya, “Chungi iwire gi mo; nikech ngʼatni e en.”<verse eid="1SA 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13"/>Omiyo Samuel nokawo tungʼne mar mo mine owire e nyim owetene kendo kochakore chiengʼno Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nobiro kuom Daudi gi teko. Bangʼe Samuel to nodok Rama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi tiyone Saulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14"/>Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye noseweyo Saulo kendo Jehova Nyasaye nochiwo thuolo mondo roho marach othage.<verse eid="1SA 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15"/>Jotich Saulo nowachone niya, “Ngʼe ni roho marach machandini, Nyasaye ema ochiwone thuolo. <verse eid="1SA 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16"/>We ruodhwa ochik jotichne man kagi mondo odwar ngʼat manyalo goyo nyatiti. Obiro goye e kindeno ma roho marach ma Nyasaye omiyo thuolo obiro kuomi to iniwinj maber.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17"/>Eka Saulo nowachone jotije niya, “Dwaruru ngʼat magoyo thum maber mondo ukelna.”<verse eid="1SA 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18"/>Achiel kuom jotich nodwoko niya, “Aseneno wuod Jesse moro ma ja-Bethlehem mongʼeyo goyo nyatiti. En ngʼat ma jachir bende en jalweny. Owuoyo maber kendo en jaber. To bende Jehova Nyasaye ni kode.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19"/>Eka Saulo nooro joote ir Jesse kawacho niya, “Orna wuodi Daudi makwayo rombe.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20"/>Eka Jesse nokawo punda mokawo makati oketo e ngʼeye, ndede mar divai kod nyadiel mi nooro Daudi ma wuode oterone Saulo.<verse eid="1SA 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21"/>Daudi nobiro ir Saulo mi nodonjo mochako tiyone. Saulo nohere ahinya, kendo Daudi nobedo achiel kuom jatingʼne gige lweny. <verse eid="1SA 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22"/>Eka Saulo nooro wach ni Jesse, kowacho niya, “Yie mondo Daudi obed jatija, nikech amor kode.”<verse eid="1SA 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23"/>E kinde duto ma Roho mar Nyasaye nobiro kuom Saulo, Daudi to ne kawo nyatiti kendo goyo. Saulo ne yudo kwe; kendo nochako winjo maber, eka roho marach ne weye.<verse eid="1SA 16:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi gi Goliath</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1"/>Koro jo-Filistia nochoko jolweny mag-gi mondo gikedi kendo negichokore kama iluongo ni Soko e piny Juda. Negijot Efes-Damin man e kind Soko gi Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2"/>Saulo gi jo-Israel to nochokore mine gibworo e Holo mar Ela kendo negichanore mondo girad gi jo-Filistia. <verse eid="1SA 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3"/>Jo-Filistia ne ni ewi got moro to jo-Israel bende ne ni e got machielo to holo ne ni e kindgi.<verse eid="1SA 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4"/>Thuon ma nyinge Goliath, ma ja-Gath nowuok koa e kambi mar jo-Filistia. Borne ne en fut ochiko. <verse eid="1SA 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5"/>Nosidho ogut mula e wiye kendo norwako koti mar lweny mar mula ma pekne oromo kilo piero abich gi abiriyo, <verse eid="1SA 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6"/>ogwendene to norwakoe mula mothedhi, kendo noliero tongʼ mar mula e ngʼeye. <verse eid="1SA 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7"/>Bond tongʼe ne chalo gi lodi, lew tonge to pekne ne romo kilo abiriyo. Jatingʼne okumba notelo nyime.<verse eid="1SA 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8"/>Goliath nochungʼ mokok ne jolweny mag Israel niya, “Angʼo momiyo ubiro kendo uriedo ne lweny? Donge an ja-Filistia, to un, donge un jotich Saulo? Yieruru ngʼato mondo olor obi kama antieni. <verse eid="1SA 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9"/>To konyalo kedo koda monega, to wabiro bedo jotiju, to ka ahinge mi anege, to ubiro bedo jotijwa ma tiyonwa.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10"/>Eka ja-Filistiano nowacho niya, “Kawuononi athiano ne jolweny mag Israel! Miyauru ngʼato mondo wakedgo.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11"/>Kane Saulo gi jo-Israel owinjo weche ja-Filistia, kibaji nogoyogi mi luoro nomakogi.<verse eid="1SA 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12"/>Daudi ne en wuod ja-Efrath miluongo ni Jesse mane oa Bethlehem e piny Juda. Jesse ne nigi yawuowi aboro to e ndalo Saulo ne en ngʼat moti ma hike ngʼeny. <verse eid="1SA 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13"/>Yawuot Jesse adek madongo noluwo Saulo e lweny. Wuowi maduongʼ ne en Eliab, mar ariyo ne Abinadab, to mar adek ne en Shama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14"/>Daudi ema ne wuowi matin kuomgi. Yawuowi adek madongo noluwo bangʼ Saulo, <verse eid="1SA 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15"/>to Daudi ne jadok kinde ka kinde koa ir Saulo mondo odhi okwa romb wuon-gi Bethlehem.<verse eid="1SA 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16"/>Kuom ndalo piero angʼwen ja-Filistiano ne wuok okinyi godhiambo konyisore.<verse eid="1SA 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17"/>Koro Jesse nowachone Daudi wuode niya, “Kaw atonga mopongʼ gi bando mobul kod makati apar mondo ireti iterne oweteni e kambigi. <verse eid="1SA 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18"/>Kaw bende chak mopoto mongʼin apar mondo itergi ne jatendgi. Nenane kaka oweteni dhi mondo iduogna wach maber moa kuomgi. <verse eid="1SA 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19"/>Gin gi Saulo gi jo-Israel duto e holo mar Ela, ka gikedo gi jo-Filistia.”<verse eid="1SA 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20"/>Okinyi mangʼich Daudi noweyo rombe gi jokwath, notweyo misike mowuok odhi kaka Jesse nonyise. Nochopo e kambi ka jolweny wuok dhi e paw lweny, ka gigoyo koko kendo gigiyo sigich lweny. <verse eid="1SA 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21"/>Jo-Israel kod jo-Filistia nochanore koni gi kocha ka gimanyore. <verse eid="1SA 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22"/>Daudi noweyo gigege gi jarit gik moko moringo odhi ir jolweny mi omoso owetene. <verse eid="1SA 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23"/>Kane pod owuoyo kodgi, Goliath mathuon jo-Filistia ma ja-Gath nowuok kuom jolweny kakok kawacho wechege mag ajara mapile kendo Daudi nowinje. <verse eid="1SA 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24"/>Kane jo-Israel oneno ngʼatno, to giduto ne giringe ka giluor ahinya.<verse eid="1SA 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25"/>Koro noyudo ka jo-Israel osebedo kawacho niya, “Donge uneno kaka ngʼatni osiko wuok? Owuok, mana mar jaro, Israel. Ruoth biro chiwo mwandu mathoth ne ngʼat monege. Bende obiro miye nyare mondo okendi, joodgi bende ok nogol osuru e Israel.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26"/>Daudi nopenjo joma nochungʼ machiegni kode niya, “Ibiro tim angʼo ne ngʼat monego ja-Filistiani magol wichkuodni e Israel? Ja-Filistia ma ok oter nyangu to en ngʼa manyalo jaro jolweny mag Nyasaye mangima?”<verse eid="1SA 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27"/>Neginwoyone weche mane oyudo giwacho mi giwachone niya, “Ma e gima ibiro timo ne ngʼat manonege.”<verse eid="1SA 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28"/>Kane Eliab mowadgi Daudi maduongʼ, owinje ka owuoyo gi ji, mirima nomake kode mopenje niya, “Ibiro ka nangʼo? To rombe manok ka to iweyo gi ngʼa e thim? Angʼeyo ni in jangʼayi bende pachi richo, isebiro mana ni mondo ine kaka lweny dhi.”<verse eid="1SA 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29"/>Daudi nowacho niya, “Koro sani to atimo angʼo? Ok anyal kata wuoyoe?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30"/>Eka nolokore mochako wuoyo gi ngʼama chielo konono mana wachno kendo ji nodwoke mana wach machalre gi manosewinjo. <verse eid="1SA 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31"/>Gima Daudi nowacho nolandore mochopo ne Saulo eka Saulo noluonge.<verse eid="1SA 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32"/>Daudi nowachone Saulo niya, “Kik chuny ji nyosre nikech ja-Filistiani; jatichni biro dhi mondo oked kode.”<verse eid="1SA 17:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33"/>Saulo nodwoko niya, “In ok inyal dhi kedo gi ja-Filistia nikech in mana rawera, to en to osebedo kokedo chakre tin-ne.”<verse eid="1SA 17:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34"/>To Daudi nowacho ni Saulo niya, “Jatichni osebedo kakwayo romb wuon-gi. Ka sibuor kata ondiek omako achiel kuom rombwa, <verse eid="1SA 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35"/>to ne alawe kendo agoye mi amaye rombo kagolo e dhoge. Kane ochikore ira, ne amake gi yie dende mi agoye kendo anege. <verse eid="1SA 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36"/>Jatichni osenego sibuor gi ondiek; ja-Filistia ma ok oter nyanguni, biro bedo achiel kuomgi nikech osejaro jolwenj Nyasaye mangima. <verse eid="1SA 17:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37"/>Jehova Nyasaye mane oresa e kok sibuor gi kok ondiek biro resa e lwet ja-Filistiani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Saulo nowachone Daudi niya, “Dhi kendo Jehova Nyasaye obed kodi.”<verse eid="1SA 17:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38"/>Eka Saulo norwako Daudi gi lawe owuon. Norwakone koti mar lweny kendo nosidhone ogudu mar mula e wiye. <verse eid="1SA 17:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39"/>Daudi notweyo liganglane ewi law mi notemo wuothogo nikech ne ok ongʼiyo gi gigo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:39">Nowachone Saulo niya, “Ok anyal dhi gi gigi nikech ok angʼiyo kodgi.” Omiyo nogonyogi oko. <verse eid="1SA 17:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40"/>Eka nokawo ludhe mi oyiero kite mapoth abich ei aora kendo noketogi e ofukune mar kwath mi otingʼo orujre e lwete kendo osudo machiegni gi ja-Filistiano.<verse eid="1SA 17:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41"/>E kindeno, ja-Filistiano gi jatingʼ kuode, ne sudo machiegni gi Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 17:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42"/>Eka norango Daudi konone moneno ni en mana rawera ma silwal, ma jaber, mine obuone. <verse eid="1SA 17:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43"/>Nowachone Daudi niya, “An guok mibirona kitongʼona kete?” Ja-Filistia nokwongʼo Daudi gi nying nyisechene. <verse eid="1SA 17:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44"/>Nowachone niya, “Bi ka abiro miyo winy ma e kor yamo ringi gi le man e thim.”<verse eid="1SA 17:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45"/>Daudi nowachone ja-Filistiano niya, “Ibirona gi ligangla kod tongʼ gi bidhi, anto abironi e nying Jehova Nyasaye Maratego, ma Nyasach jolweny Israel ma iseyanyo. <verse eid="1SA 17:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46"/>Kawuononi Jehova Nyasaye biro keti e lweta, abiro goyi piny mi angʼad ngʼuti. Kawuono abiro miyo winy mae kor polo gi le man e thim ringre jolweny mag jo-Filistia, kendo piny mangima biro ngʼeyo ni nitie Nyasaye ei Israel. <verse eid="1SA 17:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47"/>Ji duto mochokore ka biro ngʼeyo ni Jehova Nyasaye ok res joge gi ligangla gi tongʼ nimar lweny en mar Jehova Nyasaye, kendo obiro chiwou uduto e lwetwa.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48"/>Kane ja-Filistiano osudo machiegni mondo oked kode, Daudi ne oringo mapiyo piyo kochiko kar kedo mondo orom kode. <verse eid="1SA 17:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49"/>Nosoyo lwete ei mifukune mogolo kidi; eka noketo kidino e orujre mine odiro mogoyogo lend wangʼ ja-Filistiano. Kidi nodonjo e lend wangʼe mine opodho piny auma.<verse eid="1SA 17:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50"/>Omiyo Daudi noloyo ja-Filistiano gi orujre kod kidi; ka oonge gi ligangla e lwete nogoyo ja-Filistiano piny monege.<verse eid="1SA 17:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51"/>Daudi noringo mochungʼ kuome. Nokawo ligangla ja-Filistia mowuodho e olalone kane osenege, nongʼado wiye gi ligangla.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Kane jo-Filistia oneno ni thuon-gi osetho negilokore mi gichako ngʼwech. <verse eid="1SA 17:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52"/>Eka jo-Israel gi jo-Juda nosudo machiegni negigiyo sigich lweny mi gilawo jo-Filistia nyaka gichopi kama idonjogo Gath nyaka rangeye mag Ekron. Ringre jogi motho nokeyore e yo madhi Sharaim nyaka Gath gi Ekron. <verse eid="1SA 17:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53"/>Kane jo-Israel odwogo koa lawo jo-Filistia, ne giyako kargi mar bworo.<verse eid="1SA 17:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54"/>Daudi nokawo wi ja-Filistia mokelo Jerusalem, to gige lweny mag ja-Filistia notero e hembe owuon.<verse eid="1SA 17:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55"/>Kane Saulo orango Daudi e sa mane odhi rado gi ja-Filistia, nopenjo Abner mane jatend jolweny niya, “Abner wuowini en wuod ngʼa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abner nodwoko niya “Yaye ruoth, akwongʼora e nyimi ni ok angʼeye.”<verse eid="1SA 17:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56"/>Ruoth nowachone niya, “Non ane ni wuowini en wuod ngʼa?”<verse eid="1SA 17:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57"/>Mapiyo piyo kane Daudi odwogo koa nego ja-Filistia, Abner nokawe motere e nyim Saulo, kapod Daudi otingʼo wi ja-Filistia.<verse eid="1SA 17:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58"/>Saulo nopenje niya, “Wuowi matin in wuod ngʼa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">Daudi nodwoko niya, “An wuod Jesse ma ja-Bethlehem ma jatichni.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Saulo obedo gi nyiego kuom Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1"/>Kane Daudi osetieko wuoyo gi Saulo, chuny Daudi nowinjore gi mar Jonathan gi Daudi mine ohere mana kaka oherore owuon. <verse eid="1SA 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2"/>Koa odiechiengno Saulo nokawo Daudi kendo ne ok ochako odok dalagi ir wuon-gi. <verse eid="1SA 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3"/>Jonathan nokwongʼore gi Daudi nikech ne ohere mana kaka oherore owuon. <verse eid="1SA 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4"/>Jonathan nogolo lawe mane orwako momiyo Daudi, nomiye lawe mar akor, gi liganglane bende, atungʼ gi okandane.<verse eid="1SA 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5"/>Gimoro amora mane Saulo oore mondo otim, Daudi ne timo maber ahinya kuom mano Saulo nomiye rangʼiny mamalo e lweny. Ma nomiyo ji duto mor nyaka jotend lweny mag Saulo bende.<verse eid="1SA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6"/>Kane ji duogo dala bangʼ ka Daudi nosenego ja-Filistia, mon nowuok e mier matindo duto mag Israel mondo oromne Ruoth Saulo ka giwer kendo gimiel, ka igoyo tamborin gi asili. <verse eid="1SA 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7"/>Kane gimiel, ne giwer niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">“Saulo onego ji alufe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 18:7">to Daudi onego ji alufe gi alufe.”<verse eid="1SA 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8"/>Saulo ne okecho ahinya nikech wendno nochwanye, mi nowacho e chunye niya, “Ere kaka gisemiyo Daudi alufe gi alufe; to an to gimiya mana alufe kende. Angʼo modongʼne makoro ok doyudi ma kata bedo ruoth?” <verse eid="1SA 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9"/>Kochakore chiengʼno Saulo nochako bedo gi nyiego gi Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10"/>Kinyne Nyasaye nochiwo thuolo ne roho marach mobiro gi teko modonjo kuom Saulo. Noyudo okoro wach e ode, ka Daudi to ne goyo nyatiti kaka ne ojagoyo pile. Saulo ne nigi tongʼ e lwete <verse eid="1SA 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11"/>kendo nodiro tongʼ kowacho e chunye niya, “Abiro chwowo Daudi mariw gi kor ot.” To Daudi nolengʼe nyadiriyo.<verse eid="1SA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12"/>Saulo noluoro Daudi nikech Jehova Nyasaye noseweye, to ne ni kod Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13"/>Omiyo nogolo Daudi mondo oa bute mi nokete mondo obed jatend jolweny alufu achiel, kendo Daudi notelonegi e lwenje mane gidhiye. <verse eid="1SA 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14"/>Gik moko ne dhi kode maber e gimoro amora mane otimo nikech Jehova Nyasaye ne ni kode. <verse eid="1SA 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15"/>Kane Saulo oneno kaka odhi maber, mine oluore. <verse eid="1SA 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16"/>To jo-Israel duto gi jo-Juda duto ne ohero Daudi nikech notelonegi e lwenjegi.<verse eid="1SA 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17"/>Saulo nowachone Daudi niya, “Ma en Merab nyara maduongʼ. Abiro miyigo mondo ikende; to mana ka inyalo kedona gi chir ka ikedo lwenje mag Jehova Nyasaye.” Nimar Saulo nowacho e chunye niya, “Ok abi keto lweta kuome. We jo-Filistia ema otim mano!”<verse eid="1SA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18"/>To Daudi nowachone ne Saulo niya, “Anto an ngʼa kata anywolana kata dhood gi wuora gin angʼo e Israel ma dimi abed or ruoth?” <verse eid="1SA 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19"/>Kane ndalo ochopo mane Merab nyar Saulo onego omi Daudi, ne omiye Adriel ja-Mehola mondo okende.<verse eid="1SA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20"/>Koro Mikal nyar Saulo nohero Daudi, omiyo kane ginyiso Saulo wachno, to Saulo nobedo mamor. <verse eid="1SA 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21"/>Saulo noparo e chunye niya, “Abiro miyego, mondo obedne obadho mondo omi jo-Filistia oyude.” Omiyo Saulo nowachone Daudi niya, “Koro in-gi thuolo mar ariyo mondo ibed ora.”<verse eid="1SA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22"/>Eka Saulo nochiko jotichne niya, “Wuouru gi Daudi lingʼ-lingʼ kendo wachneuru ni, ‘Winji, ruoth mor kodi kendo jotije duto bende oheri koro bed ore.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23"/>Neginwoyo wechego ne Daudi. To Daudi nowacho niya, “Uparo ni en wach mayot mar bedo or ruoth? An mana ngʼama odhier bende ok angʼera.”<verse eid="1SA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24"/>Kane jotije Saulo onyise gima Daudi nowacho, <verse eid="1SA 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25"/>Saulo nodwoko niya, “Wachneuru Daudi ni, ‘Ruoth ok dwar ni inyombne, eka ikaw nyare, to odwaro mana ni mondo ikelne ringre jo-Filistia mia achiel (ma en pien duongʼ-gi), mondo ochulgo kuor ne wasike.’ ” Chenro mar Saulo ne en ni mondo Daudi opodhie lwet jo-Filistia.<verse eid="1SA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26"/>Kane jotij Saulo onyiso Daudi wechego nobedo mamor bedo or ruoth. Kane kinde moket pok orumo, <verse eid="1SA 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27"/>Daudi gi joge nodhi monego jo-Filistia mia ariyo. Nokelo ringregi (ma en pien duongʼ-gi) kendo nochiwo kar kwan-ka duto mondo omi obed or ruoth. Eka Saulo nomiye Mikal nyare mi okendo.<verse eid="1SA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28"/>Kane Saulo ofwenyo ni Jehova Nyasaye nigi Daudi kendo ni Mikal nyare ohero Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29"/>Saulo nomedo luore, kendo nosiko ka en jasike e ndalo duto mag ngimane.<verse eid="1SA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30"/>Jotend lweny mag jo-Filistia ne medo dhi e lweny, kendo kaka negimedo dhi e kaka Daudi bende ne locho moloyo jotelo mamoko mag Saulo kendo nomedo ngʼere.<verse eid="1SA 18:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Saulo otemo nego Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1"/>Saulo nowachone Jonathan ma wuode to gi jotije duto mondo gineg Daudi. To Jonathan nohero Daudi ahinya, <verse eid="1SA 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2"/>mi nosieme niya, “Tangʼ, Saulo wuora manyo yo ma donegigo. Omiyo kiny gokinyi dhiyo ipondi kendo bed mana kuno. <verse eid="1SA 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3"/>Abiro dhi oko kendo anachungʼ but wuora machiegni gi kama ipondoeno. Abiro wuoyo kode kuomi kendo abiro nyisi gima ayudo.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4"/>Jonathan nowuoyo maber kuom Daudi ne Saulo, wuon mare, mowachone niya, “Ruoth kik itim marach ne jatichni Daudi; pok otimoni marach, to osemana konyi ahinya. <verse eid="1SA 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5"/>Noyie tho chiengʼ mane onego ja-Filistia. Jehova Nyasaye nokelo loch maduongʼ ne jo-Israel duto, ne ineno mine imor. Angʼo madimi itim marach ni ngʼama onge ketho ka Daudi kinege maonge gima omiyo?”<verse eid="1SA 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6"/>Saulo nochiko ite ne wach Jonathan mi okwongʼore kowacho niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni Daudi ok nonegi.”<verse eid="1SA 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7"/>Omiyo Jonathan noluongo Daudi monyise weche duto mane giwacho. Nokele ir Saulo, mi Daudi nobedo gi Saulo kaka nosebet mokwongo.<verse eid="1SA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8"/>Lweny nochako owuok kendo, mi Daudi nowuok modhi kedo gi jo-Filistia. Nonego ji mangʼeny ma joma odongʼ noringo oa.<verse eid="1SA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9"/>To roho marach ma Jehova Nyasaye nomiyo thuolo nobiro kuom Saulo kama nobetie piny ei ode ka otingʼo tongʼe e lwete. Kane Daudi ne goyo nyatiti, <verse eid="1SA 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10"/>Saulo notemo chwowe gi tongʼ mondo oriwe gi kor ot, to Daudi nolengʼe mi tongʼ nochwowo kor ot. Otienono Daudi notony maber modhi.<verse eid="1SA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11"/>Saulo nooro ji mondo orit od Daudi kendo mondo onege gokinyi. To Mikal ma chi Daudi nosieme niya, “Ka ok iringo mi ikonyo ngimani otienoni to kiny nonegi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12"/>Eka Mikal nogolo Daudi gie dirisa, mine oringo motony. <verse eid="1SA 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13"/>Eka Mikal nokawo gima opa mopiele e kitanda, moume gi law, bangʼe oketo yie diek moko e wiye.<verse eid="1SA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14"/>Kane Saulo ooro ji mondo omak Daudi, Mikal nowacho niya, “Otuo.”<verse eid="1SA 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15"/>Kendo Saulo nooro jogo mondo odogi one Daudi mowachonegi niya, “Keleuru ira ka utingʼe e kitandane mondo omi anege.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16"/>To ka jogo nodonjo negiyudo gima opa e kitanda, to yo ka wiye to oketie yie diek.<verse eid="1SA 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17"/>Saulo nowachone Mikal niya, “Angʼo momiyo iwuonda kama kiweyo jasika dhi matony?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Mikal nowachone niya, “Nowachona ni, ‘Weya adhi. Angʼo momiyo danegi.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18"/>Kane Daudi oseringo motony, ne odhi Rama ir Samuel mi onyise timbe duto ma Saulo osetimone. Eka en gi Samuel negidhi Nayoth ma gibet kuno. <verse eid="1SA 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19"/>Wach nochopo ne Saulo niya, “Daudi ni Nayoth e gwengʼ Rama” <verse eid="1SA 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20"/>omiyo nooro ji mondo odhi omake. To kane gineno oganda jonabi ka koro wach ka gin gi Samuel kochungʼ kanyo kaka jatendgi Roho mar Nyasaye nomako joote Saulo ma gin bende negichako koro. <verse eid="1SA 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21"/>Nonyis Saulo wachno, mi nooro ji moko to gin bende ne gikoro. Eka Saulo nooro joote kendo mar adek, to gin bende negimedo mana koro. <verse eid="1SA 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22"/>Mogik en owuon nowuok modhi Rama ka nochopo e Soko maduongʼ man Seku. Nopenjo niya, “Ere Samuel gi Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:22">Negidwoke niya, “Gin Nayoth e gwengʼ Rama.”<verse eid="1SA 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23"/>Omiyo Saulo nodhi Nayoth e gwengʼ Rama. To en bende Roho mar Nyasaye nobiro kuome mi owuotho kokoro wach nyaka ochopo Nayoth. <verse eid="1SA 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24"/>Nogolo lepe mokoro wach e nyim Samuel. Nonindo kamano odiechiengʼ gotieno. Mano ema omiyo ji wacho niya, “Kare Saulo bende en achiel kuom jonabi?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi kod Jonathan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1"/>Eka Daudi noringo koa Nayoth e gwengʼ Rama mine odhi ir Jonathan mopenje niya, “Angʼo masetimo? Ere kethona? Rach mane ma asetimo ne wuonu, momiyo odwaro kawo ngimana?”<verse eid="1SA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2"/>Jonathan nodwoke niya, “Onge. Ok ibi tho! Winji, wuonwa ok tim gimoro amora, bedni oduongʼ kata otin, ma ok onyisa. Angʼo madimi opandna wachni? Ok en kamano!”<verse eid="1SA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3"/>Daudi to nowacho ka kwongʼore niya, “Wuoru ongʼeyo malongʼo kaka igena mi osewacho e chunye ni, ‘Jonathan ok onego ngʼe wachni nikech chunye nyalo bedo gi lit.’ Kata kamano akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima to gi nyingi ni kinda gi tho odongʼ mana ondamo achiel.”<verse eid="1SA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4"/>Jonathan nowacho ni Daudi niya, “Gimoro amora midwaro ni atim abiro timoni.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5"/>Omiyo Daudi nowacho niya, “Winji, kiny en Sawo mar Dwe manyien kendo nitie budho ma onego bed ni achiemo gi ruoth, to we adhi apondi oko nyaka chop odhiambo mar orucha. <verse eid="1SA 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6"/>Ka wuonu ok onena e nyasini, to nyise ni, ‘Daudi nokwaya mondo amiye thuolo odhi dalagi Bethlehem mapiyo piyo, nikech anywolagi duto nigi misango mar higa ka higa.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7"/>Ka owacho ni, ‘Mano ber,’ eka anabed gi adieri ni jatichni nigi kwe. To ka mirima omake, to ibiro bedo gi adiera ni oseketo chunye ni nyaka to onega. <verse eid="1SA 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8"/>In to koro bed ja-adiera ne jatichni, nikech isekwongʼori kode e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. To ka an jaketho to nega in iwuon! Angʼo ma dimi iketa e lwet wuonu?”<verse eid="1SA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9"/>Jonathan nowachone niya, “Mano ok nyal timore! Ka dine angʼeyo kata mana matin ni wuora dwaro timoni marach, donge danyisi?”<verse eid="1SA 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10"/>Daudi nopenje niya, “Ngʼa mabiro wachona ka wuonu odwoki gi gero?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11"/>Jonathan nowacho niya, “Bi wadhi kuma opondo.” Omiyo negidhi giduto.<verse eid="1SA 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12"/>Eka Jonathan nowachone Daudi niya, “Gi nying Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel, abiro wuoyo gi wuora e sa maka ma orucha! Ka en gi paro maber kuomi, to donge abiro anyisi? <verse eid="1SA 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13"/>To ka wuora nigi chuny mar hinyi, to aweyo ma ok anyisi kendo konyi mondo itony idhi gi kwe, to mondo Jehova Nyasaye ochwada malit. Mad Jehova Nyasaye obed kodi mana kaka osebedo gi wuora. <verse eid="1SA 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14"/>To yie itimna ngʼwono mana machal gi ngʼwono mosiko mar Jehova Nyasaye e ndalo duto mag ngimana, mondo kik nega, <verse eid="1SA 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15"/>kendo kik iwe timo ngʼwono ni jooda kata mana ka Jehova Nyasaye osetieko wasik Daudi e wangʼ piny.”<verse eid="1SA 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16"/>Omiyo Jonathan nokwongʼore gi joka Daudi, kowacho niya, “Mad Jehova Nyasaye mondo ongʼad bura ne wasik Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17"/>Omiyo Jonathan noketo Daudi mochako ojiwo kwongʼruokne nikech nohere, nimar nohere mana kaka oherore owuon.<verse eid="1SA 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18"/>Eka Jonathan nowachone Daudi niya, “Kiny en Sawo mar dwe manyien kendo kiny nongʼere ni ionge nikech komi nobed nono. <verse eid="1SA 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19"/>To kochopo orucha kar odhiambo kanyo to idhi kama ne ipondoe mokwongo ka wechegi nochakore kendo irit but kit Ezel. <verse eid="1SA 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20"/>Abiro diro aserni adek e bathe kanyo, ka gima atemo lengʼo gimoro. <verse eid="1SA 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21"/>Eka abiro oro rawera kawachone ni, ‘Dhi idwar aserni.’ To kawachone ni, ‘Ne, aserni ni e bathi koni; kelgi ka, eka ibi, nikech akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni onge gima biro hinyi kendo onge gima rach.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22"/>To ka awachone rawera ni, ‘Ne, aserni ni nyimi,’ eka nyaka idhi nikech Jehova Nyasaye dwaro ni idhi adhiya. <verse eid="1SA 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23"/>To kuom weche mawasewuoyoe to ipar, nimar Jehova Nyasaye en janeno e kindwa nyaka chiengʼ.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24"/>Omiyo Daudi nopondo oko kendo kane Sawo mar Dwe manyien ochopo, to ruoth nobet piny mondo ochiem. <verse eid="1SA 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25"/>Nobet kare mane ojabetie but kor ot, ka gimanyore gi Jonathan, Abner to nobet bath Saulo, kom Daudi to ne ninono. <verse eid="1SA 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26"/>Saulo ne ok owacho gimoro chiengʼno, nikech noparo e chunye niya, “Nyaka bed ni Daudi osetimo gimoro marach, omiyo ok oler adiera emomiyo ok obiro e nyasi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27"/>To kata mana kinyne, ma en chiengʼ mar ariyo mar dwe, kom Daudi ne pod ninono. Eka Saulo nowachone Jonathan wuode niya, “Angʼo momiyo wuod Jesse ok obiro e chiemo, chakre nyoro nyaka kawuono?”<verse eid="1SA 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28"/>Jonathan nodwoko niya, “Daudi nohomba kokwaya thuolo mondo odhi Bethlehem.” <verse eid="1SA 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29"/>Nokwayo niya, “Yiena mondo adhi nikech joodwa timo misango e dala kendo owadwa nochika matek ni nyaka achop kuno. Koro akwayi ni yie ingʼwon-na mondo adhi ane owetena. Mano ema omiyo ok osebiro e mesa ruoth.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30"/>Saulo notoyo mirimbe kuom Jonathan mowachone niya, “In wuod dhako ma wiye tek kendo ma ja-mahundu! Donge angʼeyo ni isebedo jakor wuod Jesse makelo wichkuot ne in iwuon kendo ne minu monywoli? <verse eid="1SA 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31"/>Ka wuod Jesse pod ngima e pinyni to in kata pinyruodhi ok nyal gurore. Koro or wach mondo okelnago nikech nyaka otho!”<verse eid="1SA 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32"/>Jonathan nopenjo wuon-gi niya, “Angʼo momiyo nyaka otho? Angʼo mosetimo?” <verse eid="1SA 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33"/>To Saulo nobaye gi tongʼ mondo onege. Eka Jonathan nongʼeyo ni kare wuon-gi dwaro nego Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34"/>Jonathan nochungʼ moa e mesa ka mirima mager omake chiengʼ mar ariyo mar dwe mane ok ochiemo, nikech chunye ne lit kod timbe wuon-gi mag wichkuot mane otimone Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 20:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35"/>Kinyne gokinyi Jonathan nodhi oko e kargi mar romo gi Daudi. Ne en-gi wuowi matin, <verse eid="1SA 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36"/>kendo nowachone wuowino niya, “Ringi mondo idwar aserni madirogi.” E sa ma wuowino ne ringo, nodiro asere mokadhe. <verse eid="1SA 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37"/>Ka wuowino nochopo kama asech Jonathan ne olwarie, Jonathan noluonge gi dwol maduongʼ niya, “Donge asere ni nyimi kanyo?” <verse eid="1SA 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38"/>Eka nokok kowacho niya, “Reti! Dhi piyo! Kik ichungʼ!” Wuowino nokwanyo asereno mi odok ir ruodhe. <verse eid="1SA 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39"/>Wuowino ne ok ongʼeyo gimoro amora mane timore, makmana Jonathan gi Daudi kende ema nongʼeyo. <verse eid="1SA 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40"/>Eka Jonathan nomiyo wuowino gige mag lweny mowachone niya, “Dhiyo idwokgi dala.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41"/>Bangʼ ka wuowino nosedhi, Daudi nowuok yo milambo mar dir kidi, mi okulore piny e nyim Jonathan nyadidek ka lend wangʼe mulo piny. Eka ne gimosore ma giywak giduto to Daudi noywak moloyo.<verse eid="1SA 20:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42"/>Jonathan nowachone Daudi niya, “Dhi gi kwe nimar wasesingore e nyim Jehova Nyasaye ni osiep man e kindwa kodi ka wakwongʼore niya, Jehova Nyasaye obed janeno e kindi koda kendo e kind nyikwayi kod nyikwaya nyaka chiengʼ” Eka Daudi nowuok to Jonathan bende nodok dala.<verse eid="1SA 20:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi odhi Nob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1"/>Daudi nodhi Nob ir Ahimelek jadolo. Ahimelek nokirni kane oromo kode mopenjo niya, “Angʼo momiyo in kendi? Angʼo momiyo ngʼato ok obiro kodi?”<verse eid="1SA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2"/>Daudi nodwoko Ahimelek jadolo niya, “Ruoth oseora e ote moro konyisa ni, ‘Kik ngʼato ngʼe gimoro amora kuom oteni kod gik monyisi mondo itim.’ Joga to asechiko mondo waromgo kamoro. <verse eid="1SA 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3"/>Angʼo ma in-go ka sani? Miya makati abich kata gimoro amora minyalo yudo.”<verse eid="1SA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4"/>To jadolo nodwoko Daudi niya, “Aonge gi makati moro amora makmana nitiere moko mowal ka, ginyalo tiyo kode mana ka giseritore ma ok gibedo e achiel gi mon.”<verse eid="1SA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5"/>Daudi nodwoke niya, “Adier wasebedo mabor gi mon, mana kaka wajatimo kinde ma awuok oko. Ringre chwo to ler kata mana e ote moko ma ok ler. To koro kawuononi digibed maler maromo nade!” <verse eid="1SA 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6"/>Eka jadolo nomiye makati mowal nikech ne onge makati moro amora makmana makati moket e Nyim Jehova Nyasaye migolo oko chiengʼ miketo makati maliet kargi.<verse eid="1SA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7"/>Koro jatich Saulo moro ne nitie kanyo chiengʼno mane ogengʼne e nyim Jehova Nyasaye; ne en Doeg ma ja-Edom, mane jatend jokwadh Saulo.<verse eid="1SA 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8"/>Daudi nopenjo Ahimelek niya, “Donge dibedie gi tongʼ kata ligangla moro amora ka? Ne ok akawo ligangla kata gir lweny moro amora, nikech ote ruoth nobirona mapiyo.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9"/>Jadolo nodwoke niya, “Ligangla Goliath ja-Filistia, mane inego e holo mar Ela, nika; oboye gi law en e tok law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod. Ka idware to kawe, onge ligangla moro makmana mano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">Daudi nowacho niya, “Onge moro amora machal kode; miyago.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi odhi Gath</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10"/>Chiengʼno Daudi noringo Saulo mi odhi ir Akish ruoth Gath. <verse eid="1SA 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11"/>To jotich Akish nowachone niya, “Donge ngʼatni e Daudi ma ruodh pinygi? Donge en ema gimielne ka giwer ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 21:11">“ ‘Saulo osenego ji alufe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 21:11">to Daudi onego alufe gi alufe’?”<verse eid="1SA 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12"/>Wechegi nodonjo e chuny Daudi mi nomiyo oluoro Akish ruoth Gath ahinya. <verse eid="1SA 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13"/>Omiyo nowuondore ni en janeko e nyimgi kanyo, kane en e lwetgi notimo timbe mag janeko, kogwaro dhorangach kendo koweyo olawo wuok e dhoge nyaka e yie tike.<verse eid="1SA 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14"/>Akish nowachone jotije niya, “Ngʼiuru ngʼatni en janeko! Angʼo momiyo ukele ira? <verse eid="1SA 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15"/>Uparo ni aonge gi joneko moromo momiyo ukelo ngʼatni e nyima? Ne ochuno ni nyaka ngʼatni bi e oda?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi odhi Adulam kod Mizpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1"/>Daudi nowuok Gath moringo odhi e rogo mar Adulam. Kane owetene kod joodgi duto owinjo wachno, negidhi ire kuno. <verse eid="1SA 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2"/>Ji duto mane nigi chandruok kata mane nigi gowi kata nigi ngʼur moro amora nochokore modhi ire, mine obet jatendgi. Ne gin chwo madirom mia angʼwen mane ni kode.<verse eid="1SA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3"/>Ka Daudi noa kanyo nodhi Mizpa e piny Moab mowachone ruoth Moab niya, “Bende diyie mondo wuora gi minwa obi odag kodi nyaka angʼe gima Nyasaye biro timona?” <verse eid="1SA 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4"/>Omiyo noweyogi gi ruodh Moab mine gidak kode e ndalo duto mane Daudi ni kar pondo.<verse eid="1SA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5"/>Janabi Gad nowachone Daudi niya, “We dak kar pondo, dhi e piny Juda.” Omiyo Daudi nowuok modhi e bungu man Hereth.<verse eid="1SA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo onego jodolo mag Nob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6"/>Koro Saulo nowinjo ni osefweny kuma Daudi gi joge nitie. To Saulo noyudo obet piny e tiend yath moro ewi got man Gibea kotingʼo tongʼ e lwete kolwore gi jodonge. <verse eid="1SA 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7"/>Saulo nowachonegi niya, “Winjuru, un jo-Benjamin! Bende wuod Jesse nomiu puothe gi puoth mzabibu? Bende enoketu jotend jolweny alufe kata jatend jolweny miche? <verse eid="1SA 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8"/>Kare mano emomiyo uduto useriworuna? Onge ngʼato angʼata manyisa ka wuoda timo singruok gi wuod Jesse. Onge ngʼama dewo gima timorena kata manyisa ni wuoda osethuwo jatija mondo obutna ka rita kaka koro otimoni.”<verse eid="1SA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9"/>Eka Doeg ja-Edom, manoyudo ochungʼ gi jodong Saulo, nowacho niya, “Ne aneno ka wuod Jesse odhi ir Ahimelek wuod Ahitub man Nob. <verse eid="1SA 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10"/>Ahimelek nopenjone wach kuom Jehova Nyasaye, nomiye chiemo bende gi ligangla mar Goliath ja-Filistia.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11"/>Eka ruoth nooro joote mondo oom Ahimelek jadolo ma wuod Ahitub kaachiel gi joodgi duto, mane gin jodolo e Nob, kendo giduto negibiro ir ruoth. <verse eid="1SA 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12"/>Saulo nowacho niya, “Koro winji wuod Ahitub.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Nodwoke niya, “Ruodha awinjo.”<verse eid="1SA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13"/>Saulo nopenje niya, “Marangʼo useriworuna, in kod wuod Jesse, ka imiye makati, kod ligangla kendo ka ipenjone wach kuom Nyasaye, mi koro osengʼanyona kendo obuto korita, mana kaka otimo kawuononi?”<verse eid="1SA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14"/>Ahimelek nodwoko ruoth niya, “Ere ngʼat ma ja-adiera kuom jotiji duto machal gi Daudi ori ma jatend joma riti, kendo mogen moloyo e odi mangima? <verse eid="1SA 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15"/>Iparo ni mano e odiechiengʼ mokwongo mapenjonee Nyasaye wach? Ooyo ok en kamano! Ruoth kik iketne jatichni bura kata joodgi bura, nikech jatichni ok ongʼeyo gima dhi nyime ka.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16"/>To ruoth nowacho niya, “Nyaka itho, in Ahimelek gi joodu duto.”<verse eid="1SA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17"/>Eka ruoth nowachone joritne mane ni bute niya, “Lokreuru mondo uneg jodolo mag Jehova Nyasaye, nikech gisedok jokor Daudi. Negingʼeyo ni oringo to negitamore nyisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:17">To jodong ruoth ne ok oyie mondo gineg jodolo mag Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="1SA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18"/>Omiyo ruoth nochiko Doeg niya, “Lokri mondo ineg jodolo.” Omiyo Doeg ja-Edom nonegogi. Chiengʼno nonego joma orwako lewni mayom mag dolo miluongo ni efod maromo ji piero aboro gabich. <verse eid="1SA 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19"/>Eka nodhi Nob, e dala mar jodolo kendo kanyo nonegoe chwo, mon, nyithindo nyaka madhoth, dhok, punde kod rombe. Magi duto nonego gi ligangla.<verse eid="1SA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20"/>To Abiathar wuod Ahimelek ma wuod Ahitub notony moringo odhi ir Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21"/>Abiathar nonyiso Daudi ni Saulo osenego jodolo mag Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22"/>Eka Daudi nowachone Abiathar niya, “E odiechiengʼno ka Doeg ja-Edom ne ni kanyo ne angʼeyo adier ni nyaka ne onyis Saulo. An ema akelo tho ne joka wuonu duto. <verse eid="1SA 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23"/>Bed koda ka; kik iluor; ngʼato madwaro negino an bende odwaro nega. Onge gima nohinyi ka in koda.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oreso Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1"/>Kane owach ne Daudi niya, “Ne jo-Filistia kedo gi jo-Keila kendo giyako gik man e laru mar dino cham,” <verse eid="1SA 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2"/>nopenjo Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Bende owinjore adhi kendo amonj jo-Filistia-gi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Jehova Nyasaye nodwoke niya, “Dhiyo, mondo imonj jo-Filistia kendo ires Keila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3"/>To jo-Daudi nowachone niya, “Ka Juda ka ema waluorie. Dobednwa machalo nade ka wadhi Keila mondo waked gi jolweny mag Filistia!”<verse eid="1SA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4"/>Daudi nopenjo Jehova Nyasaye kendo mi Jehova Nyasaye nodwoke ne, “Lor idhi Keila nimar adhi chiwo jo-Filistia e lweti.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5"/>Omiyo Daudi gi joge nodhi Keila, mokedo gi jo-Filistia kendo opeyo jambgi. Nonego jo-Filistia mangʼeny mine oreso jo-Keila. <verse eid="1SA 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6"/>Koro Abiathar wuod Ahimelek nosebiro gi law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod e kinde mane oringo kodhi ir Daudi Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo olawo Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7"/>Nowach ne Saulo ni Daudi nosedhi Keila, omiyo nowacho niya, “Nyasaye osechiwe e lweta, nimar Daudi osetwere owuon ka odonjo e dala man-gi rangeye kod lodi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8"/>Omiyo Saulo noluongo joge duto makedo ne lweny, mondo gilor gidhi Keila kendo gigengʼ ne Daudi gi joge.<verse eid="1SA 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9"/>Kane Daudi owinjo ni Saulo chano yor yude nowachone Abiathar jadolo niya, “Kel law akor mar law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10"/>Daudi nowacho niya, “Yaye Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel, jatichni osewinjo gadiera ni Saulo chano biro Keila mondo oketh dala nikech an. <verse eid="1SA 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11"/>Bende jo-Keila nochiwane? To bende Saulo biro biro ka kaka jatichni osewinjo? Yaye Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel, nyis jatichni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Eka Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko niya, “Obiro biro.”<verse eid="1SA 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12"/>Daudi nopenjo kendo niya, “Jo-Keila biro chiwa kaachiel gi joga ne Saulo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">To Jehova Nyasaye nowacho niya, “Gibiro timo kamano.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13"/>Omiyo Daudi gi joge maromo mia auchiel, nowuok Keila mine giwuotho koni gi kocha ka gisiko gidar. Kane Saulo owinjo ni Daudi nosetony mowuok Keila ne ok odhi kuno.<verse eid="1SA 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14"/>Daudi nodak e kuonde mag pondo manie thim kendo e gode mag Thim Zif; odiechiengʼ ka odiechiengʼ Saulo ne osiko ka dware, to Nyasaye ne ok oketo Daudi e lwete.<verse eid="1SA 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15"/>Kane Daudi ni Horesh man e thim Zif noyudo wach ni Saulo nosewuok mondo otiek ngimane. <verse eid="1SA 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16"/>To Jonathan wuod Saulo nodhi Horesh ir Daudi mokonye koduogo chunye mondo oyud teko moa kuom Nyasaye. <verse eid="1SA 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17"/>Nowacho niya, “Kik iluor. Saulo wuora ok bi timi gimoro. Ibiro bedo ruodh Israel, to an abiro bedo jalupni. Kata Saulo wuora ongʼeyo mano.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18"/>Kargi ji ariyogi negisingore e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. Eka Jonathan nodhi dala to Daudi to nodongʼ Horesh.<verse eid="1SA 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19"/>Jo-Zif nodhi Gibea ir Saulo mi giwachone ne, “Donge Daudi opondo kuomwa e kuonde pondo Horesh ewi got Hakila, mantie yo milambo mar Jeshimon? <verse eid="1SA 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20"/>Koroni, yaye Ruoth, inyalo biro sa moro amora midwaro biroe, to obiro bedo wachwa mondo wachiwe ne ruoth.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21"/>Saulo nodwoko niya, “Jehova Nyasaye mondo ogwedhu kuom timona maber. <verse eid="1SA 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22"/>Dhiuru kendo umed ikoru. Nonuru mondo ungʼe kuma Daudi jadhiyoe kod ngʼat mosenene kuno. Gisenyisa ni en ngʼama yoreyore ahinya. <verse eid="1SA 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23"/>Nonuru konde duto mopondoe gi kuonde duto motiyogo, eka uduogna wach mobidhore. Bangʼe anadhi kodu; ka dipo ni en kanyo, to abiro dware e dhoudi duto mag Juda.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24"/>Kuom mano ne giwuok mi gidhi Zif motelone Saulo. Daudi gi joge to ne ni e Thim Maon man Araba yo milambo mar Jeshimon. <verse eid="1SA 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25"/>Saulo gi joge nochako dwero, ka nowach ne Daudi wachno, nolor mwalo e lwanda mi nobet e Thim man Maon. Kane Saulo owinjo ma, nodhi e Thim man Maon kolawo Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26"/>Saulo ne dhi e bath got konchiel to Daudi gi joge ne ni e bathe kumachielo, ka giringo mondo gi yomb Saulo. Ka Saulo gi jolwenje ne chiegni juko Daudi gi joge mondo gimakgi, <verse eid="1SA 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27"/>jaote nobiro ir Saulo, mowacho niya, “Bi piyo! Jo-Filistia osebiro monjo piny.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28"/>Eka Saulo noweyo lawo Daudi mi odhi rado gi jo-Filistia. Mano emomiyo iluongo kanyo ni Sela Hamalekoth.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sela Hamalekoth </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiende ni </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kama lwanda opogoree.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29"/>To Daudi nodhi malo koa kanyo modak e kuonde pondo mag En Gedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi ongʼwono ne Saulo ma ok onege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1"/>Bangʼ ka Saulo nosea lawo jo-Filistia, nowachne niya, “Daudi nitie e Thim En Gedi.” <verse eid="1SA 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2"/>Omiyo Saulo nokawo ji alufu adek; ji moyier kowuok e Israel duto, eka noikore mowuok kodhi dwaro Daudi gi joge but Rogo ma Nyakech pondoe.<verse eid="1SA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3"/>Nobiro e abila mar rombe man but yo; to kanyo ne nitie rogo, to Saulo nodonjo e rogono mondo olosre. Daudi gi joge bende ne osedonjo ei rogono. <verse eid="1SA 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4"/>Jogo nowacho niya, “Ma e odiechiengʼ ma Jehova Nyasaye nowuoyo kuome kowacho ni, ‘Abiro keto jowasiki e lweti mondo itimne kaka idwaro!’ ” Eka Daudi nosudo lingʼ-lingʼ mongʼado riak law Saulo.<verse eid="1SA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5"/>Bangʼe chuny Daudi nochandore nikech nosengʼado riak law Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6"/>Nowachone joge niya, “Jehova Nyasaye ok oyie mondo atim gima kamano ni ruodha, ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye mowir, kata tingʼo lweta mondo ahinye; nikech en ngʼat mowir ma Jehova Nyasaye oyiero.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7"/>Kamano Daudi nokwero joge kendo ne ok oyienegi mondo gitug dhawo gi Saulo. Omiyo Saulo nowuok e rogo modhi e yore.<verse eid="1SA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8"/>Eka Daudi nowuok oko mar rogo mi oluongo Saulo, “Ruodha ma ruoth!” Kane Saulo ongʼiyo chien, Daudi nokulore piny monindo auma ka wangʼe ochiko piny. <verse eid="1SA 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9"/>Nowachone Saulo niya, “Angʼo momiyo ichiko iti ka ji wachoni ni, ‘Daudi dwaro hinyi’? <verse eid="1SA 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10"/>Kawuononi iseneno gi wangʼi kaka Jehova Nyasaye ne oketi e lweta ei rogo. Jomoko ne owachona ni anegi, to ne aweyi; mi awacho ni, ‘Ok natingʼ lweta mar hinyo ruodha nikech en ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye mowir.’ <verse eid="1SA 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11"/>Ne, wuora, ngʼi ine riak lawi ma an-go e lweta! Ne angʼade e riak lawi to ne ok anegi. Sani koro inyalo neno kendo fwenyo ni aonge gi paro mar timoni marach kata ngʼanyoni. Pok akethoni to in to ilawa mondo inega. <verse eid="1SA 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12"/>Mad Jehova Nyasaye ngʼad bura e kinda kodi. Mad Jehova Nyasaye chul kuor kuom gik maricho misetimona, an to lweta ok nomuli. <verse eid="1SA 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13"/>Mana kaka ngero machon wacho ni, ‘Joma timo timbe maricho ema timbe maricho wuok kuomgi’ omiyo ok abi keto lweta kuomi.<verse eid="1SA 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14"/>“En ngʼama ruodh Israel dwaro mondo onegi? Ilawo ngʼa? Guok motho koso kikun? <verse eid="1SA 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15"/>Mad Jehova Nyasaye bed jangʼad buchwa mondo opog wach e kindwa. Mad onon wach makare kendo otingʼa malo; mad ochwaka kendo oresa e lweti.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16"/>Kane Daudi otieko wuoyo, Saulo nopenjo niya, “Mano en dwondi Daudi wuoda?” Eka noywak matek. <verse eid="1SA 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17"/>Eka nowachone Daudi niya, “In ngʼama kare maloya. Isetimona maber, an to asetimoni marach. <verse eid="1SA 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18"/>Koroni eka isewachona tim maber misetimona; Jehova Nyasaye noketa e lweti to ne ok inega. <verse eid="1SA 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19"/>Ka ngʼato onwangʼo jasike, bende oweye odhi ma ok ohinye? Mad Jehova Nyasaye chuli mathoth kuom gima itimona kawuononi. <verse eid="1SA 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20"/>Angʼeyo ni adieri ibiro bet ruoth kendo pinyruodh Israel nodhi nyime maber e bwo lochni. <verse eid="1SA 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21"/>Koro singrina gi nying Jehova Nyasaye ni ok ningʼad nyikwaya kata rucho nyinga oko e od wuora.”<verse eid="1SA 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22"/>Omiyo Daudi nosingore ne Saulo. Eka Saulo nodok dala, to Daudi gi joge nodhi e kargi mar pondo.<verse eid="1SA 24:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi, Nabal kod Abigael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1"/>Koro Samuel notho, kendo Israel duto nochokore moywage; mine giike e dalane Rama. Bangʼe Daudi nowuok molor piny e Thim Paran.<verse eid="1SA 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2"/>Ne nitie ngʼat moro e piny Maon mane nigi mwandu Karmel, ne en jamoko ahinya. Ne en gi diek alufu achiel gi rombe alufu adek, mane ongʼado yiegi e Karmel. <verse eid="1SA 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3"/>Ne iluonge ni Nabal to chiege ne iluongo ni Abigael. Ne en dhako mariek kendo ne ojaber, to chwore ne ja-dhood Kaleb, ne en ngʼama koch, jagwondo kendo ma timbene richo.<verse eid="1SA 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4"/>Kane Daudi ni e thim, nowinjo ni Nabal ngʼado yie rombe. <verse eid="1SA 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5"/>Omiyo nooro yawuowi apar mowachonegi niya, “Dhiuru Karmel ir Nabal mondo umosnago. <verse eid="1SA 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6"/>Wachneuru ni, ‘Idag amingʼa! Ngimani bende obed maonge tuoche in kaachiel gi odi! Kendo gigi duto obed gi ngima maber!<verse eid="1SA 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7"/>“ ‘Koro asewinjo ni ingʼado yie rombi e kindeni. Kane jokwadhi ni kodwa, to ne ok watimonegi marach, kendo e kinde duto mane gin Karmel onge girgi manolal. <verse eid="1SA 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8"/>Penj jotiji iwuon kendo gibiro nyisi. Omiyo tim tim ngʼwono ne yawuota ma aorogo kaka wabiro e kinde mag mor. Yie imi wasumbinigi gi wuodi Daudi gimoro amora minyalo miyogi.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9"/>Kane jo-Daudi ochopo neginyiso Nabal wach ote Daudi, eka negirito.<verse eid="1SA 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10"/>Nabal nodwoko jotich Daudi niya, “Daudi-ni to en ngʼa? Wuod Jesseni to en ngʼa? Jotich mangʼeny ndaloni ngʼanyo ne ruodhigi. <verse eid="1SA 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11"/>Angʼo momiyo dakaw kuona gi piga to gi ringa ma aseyangʼo ne jongʼadna yie rombe mondo ami joma akia kuma oaye?”<verse eid="1SA 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12"/>Jo-Daudi nowichore mi odok. Kane gichopo, neginyiso Daudi weche duto. <verse eid="1SA 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13"/>Daudi nowachone joge niya, “Kawuru liganglau!” Omiyo negikawo liganglagi Daudi bende nokawo mare. Ji madirom mia angʼwen nodhi gi Daudi, to mia ariyo nodongʼ karito gigegi.<verse eid="1SA 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14"/>Achiel kuom jotich nonyiso chi Nabal ma Abigael niya, “Daudi nooro joote koa e thim mondo obi omos jaduongʼwa, to nobayonegi wach. <verse eid="1SA 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15"/>Kata kamano jogi noritowa maber ahinya. Ne ok gitimonwa marach, to bende e kinde mane wan oko e pap kodgi onge gimoro mane olal. <verse eid="1SA 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16"/>Otieno gi odiechiengʼ ne gibedonwa ka ohinga molworowa kinde duto ka wakwayo rombewa butgi. <verse eid="1SA 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17"/>Koro par ane wach kendo ne gima inyalo timo, nikech chandruok dhi biro ne ruodhwa gi joge duto. Nikech en ngʼat ma achach maonge ngʼama nyalo wuoyo kode.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18"/>Abigael ne ok oketho seche. Nokawo makati mia ariyo, ndede ariyo mar divai, rombe abich moyangʼ gi chamb aloda madirom kilo piero adek gabiriyo, olemb raisin mongʼin maromo mia achiel, gi olemb ngʼowu molos mopamore moromo mia ariyo, eka noketogi e punde. <verse eid="1SA 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19"/>Eka nowachone jotije niya, “Dhiuru nyime an abiro bangʼu.” To ne ok onyiso chwore ma Nabal.<verse eid="1SA 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20"/>Kane oyudo odhi koidho pundane e hoho manie got, to nyime kanyo noneno Daudi gi joge kalor e got biro kochome kendo noromo kodgi. <verse eid="1SA 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21"/>Daudi noyudo osewacho niya, “Kara ne en gima nono ka athagora gi rito mwandu ngʼatni e thim, maonge kata mana gire mane olal. To osechula mana rach kar ber mane atimone. <verse eid="1SA 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22"/>Mad Nyasaye kum Daudi malit ka dipo ni kiny piny orune ngʼato angʼata madichwo e dala maweyo kapod ngima!”<verse eid="1SA 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23"/>Kane Abigael oneno Daudi nolor piyo koa e pundane mane oidho mine mokulore e nyim Daudi nyaka e lowo. <verse eid="1SA 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24"/>Nopodho piny e tiend Daudi mi owacho kama: “Ruodha we rach obed e wiya awuon. Kiyie to we jatichni owuo kodi; winj gima jatichni dwa wacho. <verse eid="1SA 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25"/>Mad ruodha mondo kik odew ngʼat ma achach ma Nabal. Ochalo mana gi nyinge, nyinge tiende ni ngʼat mofuwo, kendo otimo tim fuwo kuonde duto. An to ne ok aneno joma ne ruodha ooro.<verse eid="1SA 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26"/>“Emomiyo koro ruodha, Jehova Nyasaye oseriti mondo kik ichwer remo kendo mondo kik ichul kuor gi lweti to akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima kendo gi in iwuon ni mad wasiki kod ji duto machano timoni marach ochal gi Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27"/>Yie mondo michni, ma jatichni osekelo ni ruodha, mondo omi joma luwi.<verse eid="1SA 25:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28"/>“Yie iwene jatichni kethone, nimar Jehova Nyasaye nyaka nomi dhood ruodha loch mosiko, nikech okedo lwenje mag Jehova Nyasaye. Kik iyie ketho moro oyud kuomi kapod ingima. <verse eid="1SA 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29"/>Kata obedo ni ngʼato lawi mondo otiek ngimani, to ngima mar ruodha notwe motegno gi kanyakla mar joma ngima gi Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi. To ngima wasiki to nowit mabor mana ka gima odir gorujre. <verse eid="1SA 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30"/>Kane Jehova Nyasaye osetimo ni ruodha gik mabeyo duto manosingone mi okete jatend jo-Israel, <verse eid="1SA 25:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31"/>to chuny ruodha ok nochandre nine ochwero remo mane ok onego chwer kata chulo kuor ne en wuon. To ka Jehova Nyasaye osemiyo ruodha loch to mondo ipar jatichni.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32"/>Daudi nowachone Abigael niya, “Pak obed ni Jehova Nyasaye, Nyasach Israel, moseori kawuononi mondo irom koda. <verse eid="1SA 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33"/>Mad gwedhi kuom ngʼado buchi maber kendo kuom gengʼa mondo kik achwer remo kawuononi mar chulo kuor gi lwetena awuon. <verse eid="1SA 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34"/>Ka ok kamano, to akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ma Nyasach Israel, mosegengʼa mondo kik ahinyi, ka dine ok ibiro piyo mondo iromna, to dine ok odongʼ dichwo moro amora ka Nabal.”<verse eid="1SA 25:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35"/>Eka Daudi noyie mokawo gik mane osekelone mi owacho niya, “Dhi dala gi kwe. Asewinjo wecheni kendo aseyie gi kwayoni.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36"/>Ka Abigael nodhi ir Nabal ne en e ot kotimo Sawo maduongʼ ka mar ruoth. Ne omor ahinya bende ne omer. To ok nowachone gimoro nyaka piny noru. <verse eid="1SA 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37"/>To ka nochopo okinyi ka Nabal kongʼo noserumo e wangʼe, chiege nowachone gik moko duto, mi chunye notho mochalo ka kidi. <verse eid="1SA 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38"/>Bangʼ ndalo apar, eka Jehova Nyasaye nogoyo Nabal mi notho.<verse eid="1SA 25:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39"/>Kane Daudi owinjo ni Nabal osetho, nowacho niya, “Pak obed ne Jehova Nyasaye, mosechulo kuor kuom ajara mane Nabal ojarago. Osegengʼo jatichne mondo kik otim marach mi oseketo timbene maricho e wiye owuon.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Eka Daudi nooro wach ne Abigael, kopenje mondo obed chiege. <verse eid="1SA 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40"/>Jotichne ne odhi Karmel mowachone Abigael niya, “Daudi oseorowa iri mondo wateri ire idhi ibed chiege.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41"/>Nokulore piny ka okulo wiye piny auma mochopo e lowo mine owacho, “Jatichni madhako nika, oikore mar tiyonu kendo luoko tiend jotich ruodha.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42"/>Abigael noidho punda piyo piyo ka jotije abich hike kendo rite, negidhi gi joote Daudi mobedo chiege. <verse eid="1SA 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43"/>Daudi noyudo osekendo Ahinoam ma nyar Jezreel, to giduto ne gin mond Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44"/>To Saulo nosekawo nyare ma Mikal, mane chi Daudi mi omiyo Paltiel wuod Laish mane ja-Galim.<verse eid="1SA 25:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi ochako oweyo Saulo ma ok onego</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1"/>Jo-Zif nodhi Gibea ir Saulo ma giwachone niya, “Donge Daudi opondo ewi got Hakila momanyore gi Jeshimon?”<verse eid="1SA 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2"/>Eka Saulo nodhi mwalo e piny motimo ongoro e Zif, nodhi gi joge alufu adek, jo-Israel moyier, mondo odwar Daudi kuno. <verse eid="1SA 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3"/>Saulo noloso kambine but yo man e got Hakila momanyore gi Jeshimon, Daudi to ni kama otwo ma otimo ongoro. Kane oneno ni Saulo noseluwe kuno, <verse eid="1SA 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4"/>ne ooro jombetre mane ongʼeyo ratiro ni Saulo nosechopo.<verse eid="1SA 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5"/>Eka Daudi nowuok modhi kuma Saulo nojotie. Noneno kama Saulo gi Abner wuod Ner ma jatend jolwenje, noyudo osenindoe. Saulo ne nindo ei kambi, ka jolweny olwore.<verse eid="1SA 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6"/>Daudi nopenjo Ahimelek ja-Hiti gi Abishai wuod Zeruya, mowadgi Joab niya, “Ngʼama biro dhi koda mwalo e kambi ir Saulo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Abishai nowacho niya, “Abiro dhi kodi.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7"/>Daudi gi Abishai nodhi ir jolweny gotieno, Saulo nonindo kanyo e kambi kochwoyo tonge piny yo ka wiye. Abner gi jolweny nonindo kolwore.<verse eid="1SA 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8"/>Abishai nowachone Daudi niya, “Kawuono Nyasaye oseketo jasiki e lweti. Koro yiena mondo achwowe dichiel gi tonga; ok abi chwowe diriyo.”<verse eid="1SA 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9"/>To Daudi nowachone Abishai niya, “Kik inege! En ngʼa manyalo keto lwete kuom ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye mowir ma ok oket ne bura?” <verse eid="1SA 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10"/>Nowacho niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima, ni Jehova Nyasaye owuon ema nonege; kata ndalone chiengʼ moro nochopi mi otho kata nodhi e lweny mi notho kuno. <verse eid="1SA 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11"/>To Jehova Nyasaye ok diyiena ni mondo ater lweta kuom ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye mowir. Koro kaw tongʼ gi puga mar pi machiegni gi wiye kaeto wadhi.”<verse eid="1SA 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12"/>Omiyo Daudi nokawo tongʼ kod puga mar pi mane nitie machiegni gi wi Saulo kendo negidhi. Onge ngʼama nonenogi kata mane ongʼeyo wachno, bende onge ngʼama ne ochiewo. Giduto ne ginindo, nikech Jehova Nyasaye nomiyogi nindo matut.<verse eid="1SA 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13"/>Eka Daudi nongʼado modhi loka machielo mochungʼ ewi got kuma bor; ne odhi mochwalore kodgi; ne nitie thuolo malach e kindgi. <verse eid="1SA 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14"/>Nopenjo jolweny kod Abner wuod Ner niya, “Bende unyalo dwoka, Abner?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Abner nodwoke niya, “In ngʼa maluongo ruoth?”<verse eid="1SA 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15"/>Daudi nopenjo Abner niya, “Donge in ngʼama dichwo? To ere ngʼama chal kodi e Israel? Angʼo momiyo ne ok irito ruodhi ma en ruoth? Ngʼato nobiro mondo oneg ruodhi ma ruoth. <verse eid="1SA 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16"/>Gima isetimo ok ber. Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni in kod jogi uwinjoru gi tho, nikech ne ok urito ruodhu ma ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye mowir. Ranguru anena, ere tongʼ mar ruoth gi puga mar pi mane nitiere machiegni gi wiye?”<verse eid="1SA 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17"/>Saulo nochamo dwond Daudi mowacho niya, “Mano en dwondi Daudi wuoda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Daudi nodwoke niya, “Ee mano dwonda ruodha ma ruoth.” <verse eid="1SA 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18"/>Kendo nomedo wacho niya, “Angʼo momiyo ruodha lawo jatichne? Angʼo masetimo, rach mane madimi abed jaketho? <verse eid="1SA 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19"/>Koro ruoth ma ruodha oyie owinj weche ma jatije wacho. Ka diponi Jehova Nyasaye ema thuya kodi, to madoyie okaw misango. To ka dipo ni ji ema timo mano to mondo okwongʼ-gi e nyim Jehova Nyasaye! Koro giseriemba mondo kik ayud girkeni ma Jehova Nyasaye omiya kagiwacho ni, ‘Dhi iti ne nyiseche mamoko.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20"/>Koro yie mondo remba kik oo piny kuma bor gi kama Jehova Nyasaye nitie. Ruodh Israel osewuok mondo odwar kikun mana kaka ngʼato dwaro winyo e gode.”<verse eid="1SA 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21"/>Eka Saulo nowacho niya, “Asetimo marach, omiyo duogi, Daudi wuoda. Nikech ne ineno ni ngimana ber kendo owinjore bedie kawuono. Ok nachak atem mondo ahinyi kendo. Adieri asetimo tim ngʼat mofuwo kendo aseketho marach.”<verse eid="1SA 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22"/>Daudi nodwoko niya, “Tongʼ mar ruoth eri ni ka. Or achiel kuom yawuowi obi oome. <verse eid="1SA 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23"/>To Jehova Nyasaye chiwo pok ne ngʼato ka ngʼato moromore gi ratiche gi timne makare. Kawuono Jehova Nyasaye nochiwi e lweta to ne ok anyal keto lweta kuom ngʼat Jehova Nyasaye mowir. <verse eid="1SA 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24"/>Mana kaka ngimani nelongʼona kawuono, mad ngimana bende bed malongʼo ni Jehova Nyasaye mondo oresa e chandruok duto.”<verse eid="1SA 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25"/>Eka Saulo nowachone Daudi niya, “Mad gwedhi wuoda Daudi; ibiro timo gik madongo adieri inilochi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Bangʼ mano Daudi nodhi yore, to Saulo nodok dala.<verse eid="1SA 26:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi odak e piny jo-Filistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1"/>To Daudi noparo e chunye owuon niya, “Chiengʼ moro natho e lwet Saulo. Gima ber monego atim en ni onego atony karingo adhi e piny jo-Filistia. Eka Saulo nowe manya e Israel duto kendo natony e lwete.”<verse eid="1SA 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2"/>Omiyo Daudi gi ji mia auchiel mane ni kode nowuok modhi ir Akish wuod Maok ma ruodh Gath. <verse eid="1SA 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3"/>Daudi kod joge nodak Gath ka gin gi Akish. Ngʼato ka ngʼato ne nigi joode, Daudi bende ne nigi monde ariyo: Ahinoam ma nyar Jezreel gi Abigael moa Karmel mane chi Nabal manosetho. <verse eid="1SA 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4"/>Kane onyis Saulo ni Daudi oseringo odhi Gath, ne ok ochako omanye.<verse eid="1SA 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5"/>Eka Daudi nowachone Akish niya, “Ka aseyudo ngʼwono e wangʼi, to miya kamoro e achiel kuom mier matindo manie piny, mondo mi adag kuno. Angʼo momiyo jatichni didag kodi e dala maduongʼ mar ruoth?”<verse eid="1SA 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6"/>Kochakore odiechiengʼno Akish nomiye Ziklag, mosebet ka osiko e lwet ruodhi Juda nyaka chil kawuono. <verse eid="1SA 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7"/>Daudi nodak e piny Filistia kuom higa achiel gi dweche angʼwen.<verse eid="1SA 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8"/>Koro Daudi gi joge nodhi momonjo jo-Geshur, jo-Girzi, gi jo-Amalek. Kochakore chon jogi nodak e piny mochopo Shur nyaka Misri. <verse eid="1SA 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9"/>E kinde ka kinda mane Daudi omonjo pinjego ne ok oweyo dichwo kata dhako kangima, to noyako rombe, dhok, punde, gi ngamia gi lewni. Eka nodok ir Akish.<verse eid="1SA 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10"/>Kane Akish openje niya, “Tinde ne idhi monjo kanye?” Daudi to ne jawacho niya, “Aa monjo Negev e piny Juda, kata ni Negev mar Jeramel kata ni Negev mar jo-Keni.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11"/>Ne ok owe dichwo kata dhako kangima mane inyalo kel Gath, nimar noparo e chunye niya, “Ginyalo hulowa kagiwacho ni, ‘Ma e gima Daudi notimo.’ ” Kendo ma netimne e kinde duto mane odak e piny Filistia. <verse eid="1SA 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12"/>Akish nogeno Daudi kendo nowacho e chunye owuon niya, “Osebedo tik marach ne ogandane ma jo-Israel, omiyo obiro bedo jatichna nyaka chiengʼ.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1"/>E ndalogo jo-Filistia nochoko jolwenjgi mondo oked gi Israel. Akish nowacho ni Daudi niya, “Nyaka ingʼe ni in gi jogi udhi koda e lweny.”<verse eid="1SA 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2"/>Daudi nowachone niya, “To koro inine gi wangʼi gima jatiji nyalo timo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Akish nodwoke niya, “Mano ber, abiro keti jaritna e ndalo duto mar ngimana.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo gi ajwoga madhako modak Endor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3"/>Samuel nosetho kendo Israel duto noywage mine giike e dalane man Rama. Saulo noseriembo ajuoke, gi jo-nyakalondo oa e piny.<verse eid="1SA 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4"/>Jo-Filistia nochokore mobiro mojot e Shunem, ka Saulo bende nochoko jo-Israel duto modhi ojot Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5"/>Ka Saulo noneno jolwenj jo-Filistia luoro gi kihondko nomake. <verse eid="1SA 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6"/>Nopenjo Jehova Nyasaye wach, to Jehova Nyasaye ne ok odwoke e yor lek kata gi Urim kata gi dho jonabi. <verse eid="1SA 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7"/>Eka Saulo nowachone joma tiyone niya, “Dwarnauru dhako ma ja-nyakalondo, mondo adhi apenje wach.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Negidwoke niya, “Nitie moro Endor.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8"/>Mi Saulo notemo loko nenruokne korwako lewni mopogore opogore, eka en gi ji ariyo moko negidhi ir dhako ma ja-nyakalondo gotieno. Nowacho niya, “Penjna wach kuom chuny ngʼat motho kendo ikelna ngʼatno mabiro nyisi nyinge.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9"/>Eka dhakono nowachone niya, “Chutho ingʼeyo gima Saulo nosetimo. Osetieko jo-nyakalondo gi ajuoke e piny. Angʼo momiyo ichiko obadho ne ngimana, mondo okelna tho?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10"/>Saulo nokwongʼore gi nying Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni ok nokumi kuom timo ma.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11"/>Eka dhakoni nopenje niya, “En ngʼa ma idwaro mondo agolni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Nowachne niya, “Golna Samuel.”<verse eid="1SA 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12"/>Kane dhakono oneno Samuel noywak gi dwol maduongʼ mowachone Saulo niya, “Angʼo momiyo isewuonda? In Saulo!”<verse eid="1SA 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13"/>Ruoth nowachone niya, “Kik ibed maluor. Angʼo ma ineno?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">To dhakono nowachone niya, “Aneno chuny ngʼama nosetho kawuok e lowo.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14"/>To nopenje niya, “Ochalo nadi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Nowachone niya, “Jaduongʼ moti morwako law abola ema wuok.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Eka Saulo nongʼeyo ni en Samuel, mi nokulore nyaka e lowo monindo piny e lowo auma.<verse eid="1SA 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15"/>Samuel nowachone Saulo niya, “Angʼo momiyo ichanda kimiyo awuok oko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Saulo nodwoke niya, “An gi midhiero maduongʼ. Jo-Filistia osemonja kendo kedo koda, Nyasaye bende oseweya. Tinde ok odwoka, gi dwond jonabi kata e yor lek. Mano emomiyo aluongi ni mondo iwachna gima onego atim?”<verse eid="1SA 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16"/>Samuel nowacho niya, “Angʼo momiyo ipenja wach ka Jehova Nyasaye oseweyi mobedo jasiki? <verse eid="1SA 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17"/>Jehova Nyasaye osetimo mana gima nakoroni. Jehova Nyasaye osegolo loch e lweti mi omiye achiel kuom jobathi ma en Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18"/>Nikech nidagi winjo Jehova Nyasaye kendo timo kaka nochiki mondo itim ne jo-Amalek mane en-go gi mirima maduongʼ, mano emomiyo Jehova Nyasaye osetimoni gini kawuono. <verse eid="1SA 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19"/>Jehova Nyasaye dhi chiwo jo-Israel kaachiel kodi ni jo-Filistia, kendo kiny in kod yawuoti unubed koda. Jehova Nyasaye biro chiwo jolweny mag Israel ni jo-Filistia.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20"/>To gisano Saulo nogore moriere piny ka luoro omake nikech weche Samuel. Tekre norumo nikech ne pok ochiemo odiechiengʼ ngima gi otieno.<verse eid="1SA 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21"/>Kane dhakono obiro ir Saulo moneno kaka nobwok malich, nowacho niya, “Ne, jatichni madhako osetimo gima ne ichike. Ne akawo ngimana ka nono kane atimo gima ne iwacho ni atim. <verse eid="1SA 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22"/>Koro yie iwinj jatichni mondo iyiena amiyi chiemo moro minyalo chamo mondo iyud teko mar dok.”<verse eid="1SA 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23"/>Nodagi mowacho niya, “Ok nachiem.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:23">To joge noriwore gi dhakono kamedo kwaye, mi nowinjogi. Noa malo e lowo mobet e kom.<verse eid="1SA 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24"/>Dhakono ne nigi nyarwath machwe e ode, mine oyangʼe mapiyo piyo. Nokawo mogo, modwalo motedogo makati ma ok oketie thowi. <verse eid="1SA 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25"/>Eka noketo chiemo e nyim Saulo gi joge mine gichiemo. Bangʼe ne giwuok gotienono mi gidhi.<verse eid="1SA 28:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Akish odwoko Daudi Ziklag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1"/>Jo-Filistia nochoko jolwenjgi duto Afek, to jo-Israel to nojot but soko man Jezreel. <verse eid="1SA 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2"/>Kane jotend Filistia wuotho dhi kaachiel gi jolwenjgi mane ochan e migepe mag miche gi alufe, Daudi gi joge kod Akish bende ne wuotho kaluwo bangʼ-gi. <verse eid="1SA 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3"/>To jotend lweny mag jo-Filistia nopenjo niya, “Jo-Hibraniagi to timo angʼo ka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Akish nodwoko niya, “Ma, donge en Daudi, mane jatelo mar Saulo ma ruodh Israel? Osedak koda mokadho higa, to chakre chiengʼ mane oweyo Saulo nyaka chil kawuono, pok aneno rach moro kuome.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4"/>To jotend lweny mag jo-Filistia nokecho kode ma giwacho niya, “Riemb ngʼatni odogi mondo odog kama ne imiye. Ok onego odhi kodwa e lweny, nikech e kinde ma lweny dhi nyime onyalo lokore kodwa. Donge mano e yo monyalo morogo ruodhe konego jowa moko? <verse eid="1SA 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5"/>Ma donge e Daudi mane giwero e miendgi niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">“ ‘Saulo osenego ji alufu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">to Daudi osenego ji alufe kod alufe?’ ”<verse eid="1SA 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6"/>Omiyo Akish noluongo Daudi mowachone niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima, ni isebedo ngʼat migeno kendo daher mondo ibed achiel kuom jolweny maga. Chakre chiengʼ mane ibiroe ira nyaka chil kawuono, pok aneno ketho moro kuomi, kata kamano jotend jo-Filistia ok oyie kodi. <verse eid="1SA 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7"/>Omiyo wuok kae kendo idog gi kwe, kik itim gima diwangʼ ii jotend jo-Filistia.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8"/>Daudi nopenjo niya, “To angʼo masetimo? Rach mane miyudo kuom jatichni nyaka chakre chiengʼ mane abiroe nyaka chil kawuono? Angʼo mamona kedo gi wasik ruoth ma ruodha?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9"/>Akish nodwoke niya, “Angʼeyo ni isebet ka iber e wangʼa mana ka malaika mar Nyasaye; to kata kamano jotend jolweny mag jo-Filistia osewacho ni, ‘Kik odhi kodwa e lweny.’ <verse eid="1SA 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10"/>Koro chiew gokinyi in kaachiel gi jotich ruodhi mane obiro kodi mondo umond udhi ka piny yawore.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11"/>Omiyo Daudi kod joge nochiewo gokinyi mangʼich ma gidok e piny jo-Filistia, ka jo-Filistia to dhi Jezreel.<verse eid="1SA 29:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi onego jo-Amalek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1"/>Daudi kod joge nochopo Ziklag chiengʼ mar adek. Koro jo-Amalek noyudo osemonjo Negev gi Ziklag. Negipeyo Ziklag mi giwangʼe, <verse eid="1SA 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2"/>kendo gimako mon kod ji duto mane ni kanyo, jomatindo kod jomadongo ma giteroe twech. To ne ok ginego ngʼato kuomgi, to ne gikawogi ma gidhi kodgi.<verse eid="1SA 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3"/>Kane Daudi gi joge ochopo Ziklag, negiyudo ka osewangʼe gi mach kendo mondgi, yawuotgi gi nyigi nosemaki oter e twech. <verse eid="1SA 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4"/>Daudi gi joge noywak matek ma tekregi norumo makoro ok ginyal ywak. <verse eid="1SA 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5"/>Mond Daudi ariyo bende ne osemaki ma gin Ahinoam nyar Jezreel gi Abigael ma dhako ma chwore otho mane jaod Nabal ja-Karmel. <verse eid="1SA 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6"/>Daudi ne chunye ool nikech jogo ne wacho ni mondo ochiele gi kite; ka moro ka moro ne winjo lit nikech yawuote gi nyige. Daudi to noyudo teko moa kuom Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasache.<verse eid="1SA 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7"/>Eka Daudi nowachone Abiathar jadolo, ma wuod Ahimelek niya, “Kelna law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod.” Abiathar nokelone, <verse eid="1SA 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8"/>mi Daudi nopenjo Jehova Nyasaye wach ni, “Bende dalaw joma osepeyowagi. Bende dajukgi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">Nodwoke niya, “Lawgi. Chutho inijukgi mi inires jogi duto.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9"/>Daudi gi joge mia auchiel nochopo e Holo mar Besor, joge moko nodongʼ kanyo, <verse eid="1SA 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10"/>nimar ji mia ariyo nool ahinya mane ok ginyal ngʼado holono. To Daudi gi ji mia angʼwen nodhi nyime gi lepo.<verse eid="1SA 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11"/>Negiyudo ja-Misri moro e pap mi gikele ir Daudi. Negimiye pi mondo omodhi gi chiemo mondo ocham <verse eid="1SA 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12"/>nus mar kek molos gi olemb ngʼowu to gi kek molos gi resin. Nochiemo ma chunye noduogo nikech noyudo pok ochiemo kata modho pi kuom odiechienge adek gi otieno bende.<verse eid="1SA 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13"/>Daudi nopenje niya, “In ngʼat ngʼa? To in jakanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Nowacho niya, “An ja-Misri ma misumba ja-Amalek. Ruodha nojwangʼa moweya, ka tuo nogoya ndalo adek mokadho. <verse eid="1SA 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14"/>Ne wapeyo Negev mar jo-Kereth kod gwengʼ Juda to gi Negev ma piny Kaleb mine wawangʼo Ziklag.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15"/>Daudi nopenje niya, “Bende inyalo tera ir jopechogi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Nodwoke niya, “Kwongʼrina e nyim Nyasaye ni ok ninega kata dwoka e lwet ruodha, to abiro teri irgi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16"/>Notelo ni Daudi ka gilor mwalo, kendo ne giyudogi ka gike e pap, ka gichiemo kendo metho ka gin gimor maduongʼ nikech gik mane gipeyo e piny jo-Filistia gi piny Juda ne thoth ahinya. <verse eid="1SA 30:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17"/>Daudi nokedo kodgi chakre yuso piny nyaka kinyne godhiambo. Kendo ne onge ngʼat mane otony modhi makmana yawuowi mia angʼwen mane oidho ngamia kende ema noringo otony. <verse eid="1SA 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18"/>Daudi noreso gik moko duto mane jo-Amalek osepeyo kaachiel gi monde ariyo. <verse eid="1SA 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19"/>Onge gimoro amora mane olal bed ni en ngʼama tin kata ngʼama duongʼ, wuowi kata nyako, gik mane ope kata gik mane gikawo, Daudi nodwoko gik moko duto. <verse eid="1SA 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20"/>Nokawo kweth mag jamni kod mag dhok mi joge nosembogi e nyim kweth mag jamni mamoko kowacho niya, “Magi gin gik ma Daudi opeyo.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21"/>Eka Daudi noduogo e Holo mar Besor kama ji mia ariyo mane ool mane ok nyal dhi kode nodongʼie. Negibiro mondo girom ni Daudi gi ji mane ni kode. Ka Daudi gi joge nosudo machiegni nomosogi. <verse eid="1SA 30:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22"/>To joricho duto gi joma acheje mane ni ei joma luwo Daudi nowacho niya, “Nikech ne ok gidhi kodwa, ok wabi pogo kodgi gik mope ma wadwoko. To kata kamano ngʼato ka ngʼato okaw chiege gi nyithinde mondo odhigo.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23"/>Daudi nodwoko niya, “Ooyo owetena, ok onego utim kamano gi gik ma Jehova Nyasaye osemiyowa. Oseritowa mi ochiwonwa joma nomonjowa. <verse eid="1SA 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24"/>Ngʼama biro winjo wachu? Pok mar joma nodongʼ karito gigewa biro bedo marom gi pok ngʼat mane odhi e lweny. Ji duto biro yudo maromre.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25"/>Daudi noketo ma obedo chik e Israel chakre chiengʼno nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="1SA 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26"/>Ka Daudi nochopo Ziklag nooro joote gi gik mope ne jodong Juda mosiepene, kowacho niya, “Ero aoronu mich kuom gik mope mag jowasik Jehova Nyasaye.”<verse eid="1SA 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27"/>Noorgi ni joma ne ni Bethel, Ramoth Negev gi Jatir, <verse eid="1SA 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28"/>gi joma ni Aroer, Sifmoth gi Eshtemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29"/>gi Rakal; gi jogo mane ni e mier matindo mag jo-Jeramel gi jo-Keni, <verse eid="1SA 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30"/>to gi joma ni Horma, Bor Ashan gi Athak <verse eid="1SA 30:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31"/>kod Hebron; to mago man e kuonde duto ma Daudi gi joge nosebedo kadhiye.<verse eid="1SA 30:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Tho Saulo gi yawuote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1"/>Koro jo-Filistia ne kedo gi jo-Israel kendo jo-Israel noringo e nyimgi kendo joma ngʼeny nonegi e Got Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2"/>Jo-Filistia nolawo Saulo gi yawuote matek, ma neginego yawuote magin Jonathan, Abinadab kod Malki-Shua. <verse eid="1SA 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3"/>Lweny nobedo mager kama Saulo ne nitie kendo kane jodir asere ojuke to ne gihinye marach.<verse eid="1SA 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4"/>Saulo nowacho ni jatingʼne gige lweny niya, “Wuodh liganglani mondo inega, nono to joma ok oter nyangigi biro nega kendo yanya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 31:4">To jatingʼne gige lweny ne luoro omako kendo ne ok onyal timo kamano, omiyo Saulo nokawo liganglane owuon mochwoworego. <verse eid="1SA 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5"/>Kane jatingʼ gige lweny oneno ka Saulo osetho en bende nokawo liganglane mochwoworego motho kode. <verse eid="1SA 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6"/>Kamano Saulo gi yawuote adek gi jatingʼne gige lweny kod joode duto notho kaachiel e odiechiengʼno.<verse eid="1SA 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7"/>Kane jo-Israel duto mane nitie e holo to gi mago mane nitie loka aora Jordan noneno ka jolwenj Israel oseringo kendo ni Saulo gi yawuote bende osetho, negijwangʼo miechgi ma giringo. Kendo jo-Filistia nobiro modak e miechgigo.<verse eid="1SA 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8"/>Kinyne kane jo-Filistia obiro mondo oyak gige joma otho, negiyudo Saulo gi yawuote adek kotho e Got Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9"/>Negingʼado wiye oko kendo ne gilonyo gige mag lweny, bangʼe negioro joote e piny jo-Filistia duto ka gioro wach mondo oter wach e hekalu mag nyisechegi kendo ni jopinygi. <verse eid="1SA 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10"/>Negiketo gige mag lweny e hekalu mar Ashtoreth kendo negitweyo ringre e kor ohinga man Beth Shan.<verse eid="1SA 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11"/>Kane jo-Jabesh Gilead nowinjo gima jo-Filistia osetimo ni Saulo, <verse eid="1SA 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12"/>thuondigi duto nowuok mowuotho otieno duto ka gidhi Beth Shan. Negigonyo ringre Saulo gi yawuote e kor ohinga mar Beth Shan ma negikelogi Jabesh, kuma ne giwangʼogie. <verse eid="1SA 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13"/>Eka negikawo chokegi ma giyiko e tiend yath moro man Jabesh, kendo negitweyo chiemo kuom ndalo abiriyo.<verse eid="1SA 31:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31"/>
</usx>
